msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:95
msgid ""
"A humourless weapon, one of the six Elder weapons. It goes missing for years and turns up in some monster's hoard. (Effects: +15 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:95
