#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:11
msgid ""
"Breeder Slimes, 1 mated pair 287\n"
"5 Doom Bugs at 145 each 725\n"
"Total: 1012 gold\n"
"Deliver to: Joe, Pest Control, Vertigo. Back door, after dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:15
msgid "Help! I'm in Darzog's tower!--Crodo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:16
msgid ""
"Be it known that the bearer owns the ruins of Newcastle and all the land within its old walls, the rubble included.\n"
"Sold by Ebenezer, Taxman to the King, for twelve thousand gold. No refunds. The golems in the foundations convey with the land."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:18
msgid ""
"By the King's leave, the bearer may clear and dig the caved-in dungeon below Newcastle.\n"
"Artemus, for King Burlock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:20
msgid ""
"To see what is hidden, look twice: once with the eyes and once without."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:21
msgid "Let the bearer pass the gates of Castleview. By order of the Mayor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:22
msgid "Let the bearer enter Sandcaster. Vespar vouches for them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:23
msgid "The dead admit the bearer. Mind your manners."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:24
msgid ""
"The Chosen Ones may walk in Olympus. By the word of the Dragon Pharaoh."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:25
msgid ""
"X marks the spot! Dig where the three trees meet the rock.\n"
"(The three trees are drawn in three different inks.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:27
msgid ""
"Slibo's cache: on Lakeside's eastern shore, under the cairn of five stones, two paces north."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:28
msgid ""
"To the Guildmaster of Sandcaster: the bearer has earned the robes of an Archmage. Ellinger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:3
msgid ""
"The World of Xeen on 30 gold a day. Volume the First: Cloudside. By Eerie the Cartographer.\n"
"There is much to see in the World of Xeen. A traveller wishing to follow in my footsteps should expect to spend around thirty gold pieces per day on living expenses, and should arm himself well. Xeen, while beautiful, can be deadly.\n"
"Vertigo. A quiet river town in the green south-east, quieter since most of it left. The slimes are the town's own and are not, the mayor insists, dangerous. Lodging is cheap; boots are not, after a week of slime. Note the money tree in the square. I did not find any money on it either.\n"
"Rivercity, west along the river road, is built on and under a great bridge. Everything in Rivercity has a price, including the water. The robbers live under the bridge, the sorceresses by the quay, and the honest folk wherever is left. Keep one hand on your purse and the other on your other purse.\n"
"North across the savannah stands Castle Burlock, seat of good King Burlock. Only Crusaders pass the inner gate, which spared me the trouble. The plaques in its corridors are worth the walk: I am told one says \"Don't worry, be happy.\" I was not let in to check.\n"
"Asp, in the savannah's swamps, has a snake problem, in that its people are becoming snakes. Winterkill, in the snows of the south-west, is a ghost town in the plain sense. Nightshadow, by the Lifeforce Lagoon, is pleasant by night and shut by day; I did not stay to learn why.\n"
"The ruins of Newcastle lie by the lagoon. A taxman sits in a tent by the rubble and will sell them to anyone. He has not yet found anyone.\n"
"Last, a word of advice that applies to all of Cloudside: the world is flat, and it ends. The meadows east of Vertigo stop at a cliff, and below the cliff are the stars. Mind the edge."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:3
msgid "The World of Xeen on 30 gold a day: Cloudside"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:227 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:232
msgid "The moons are not aligned."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:355
msgid "The mirror shows the square, but not you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:374
msgid "The mirror shows the square, and you in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1007
msgid ""
"The permit's fine. The Megacredits aren't here. Five, please. Digging is the expensive kind of building."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1010
msgid ""
"No digging without a permit. I don't make the rules. Artemus does, and he's very fond of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1016
msgid "The Songbird"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1018
msgid ""
"Ambrose is at Griffin Pass, on the south edge of the Forbidden Zone. He asks everyone who sent them. Tell him Dimitri did, and he'll listen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1021
msgid ""
"That song... I have been sitting in the dark like a fool. Listen. When Alamar took the castle, he gave the Queen to Count Blackfang, and the Count made her a vampire. Only her own crown can undo it, and it is in her bedroom safe, upstairs, in the part of the castle that isn't back yet. The disk safes on this floor open to 64, 52, 31. And go to Ambrose, the Queen's Knight, at Griffin Pass. He has been trying to reach Blackfang for a year. Keep the bird. I'll hear it when you pass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1035 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2565 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2576
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2587 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2598
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1036
msgid ""
"Father laughed this morning. At breakfast. At nothing! Here, it's all I have that's worth anything. I took it from the guard room when nobody was guarding it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1046
msgid "The bridle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1048
msgid ""
"If the griffin bites, that is the griffin's business, not the bridle's. No refunds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1052
msgid ""
"A griffin's bridle. Double fee, as the sign says: five thousand. ... There. It hums when a griffin is near, and the griffin hums back. Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1059
msgid ""
"A griffin's bridle? Five thousand gold. Griffins are a specialty, and specialties cost extra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1065
msgid "Who sent you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1066
msgid ""
"Dimitri? Then the old bear is awake again. Good. I caught a griffin to fly into Blackfang, and the beast will not take a bridle. An enchanted one, it might. Natasha in Sandcaster could do it. Here is the bridle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1074
msgid "The griffin"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1076
msgid "The griffin is fed and grumpy. Say the word, and we fly to Blackfang."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1080
msgid ""
"It took it! Look at him, calm as a cart horse. Blackfang has no gate that opens to the living, but it has walls, and walls have tops. When you are ready, we fly. And take this, from the Queen's own purse; she would want it spent on her rescue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1089
msgid ""
"The griffin still bites anything that looks like leather. Natasha, in Sandcaster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1095
msgid "Fly to Blackfang"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1096
msgid "Hold on to something that isn't the griffin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1105
msgid ""
"It is good to see you again, my friends, but I cannot spend much time talking. I must see to my magical duties, and you must see to yours. The world is depending on us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1109
msgid ""
"Congratulations! We've done it! The castle is free! I can't thank you enough. You must now find the key to the pyramid in the castle and return the orb to the Pharaoh. I must attend to certain magical duties from now till the completion of the prophecy. Go with my blessing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1121
msgid ""
"This is fantastic! Your speedy delivery has kept us on track. The dungeon returns now. Just five more discs will bring back the last of the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1133
msgid ""
"So close! Just five discs will finish the castle. The key must be in that section!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1137
msgid ""
"Thanks for the discs, but I still need five to restore the dungeon. I would like to restore the third level first, but the mathematics forbid it. Carry on."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1141
msgid ""
"What's this? You have no discs? Do you seek to snatch defeat from the jaws of victory? There is still time to gather the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1144
msgid ""
"Why have you come to me empty handed? Did you expect congratulations? The final hour approaches while you dawdle here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1150
msgid "The crown"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1152
msgid ""
"My crown, my castle, my thanks. The Pharaoh will want his orb back, and he does not like to wait. Neither, I find, do I."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1156
msgid ""
"My crown. Put it on my head, quickly, before the hunger comes back. ... There. I am myself. Ambrose will fly me home after dark; the sun and I are not friends yet. Take this: the key to the Great Pyramid. Alamar wanted it so badly he took a castle to hide it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1168
msgid ""
"The safe in my bedroom. Three, thirty-one, sixty-two. Hurry. I am trying very hard not to look at your necks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1171
msgid ""
"Stay back. Count Blackfang made me what I am, and I am hungry all the time. Only my own crown can undo it. It is in the safe in my bedroom, in my own castle: three, thirty-one, sixty-two. Bring it, Crusaders. Please."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1178
msgid ""
"The lava round the second meteor is cool now. What fell from the sky there is not a meteor. Go and see, and be polite to whoever wakes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1182
msgid ""
"My orb. Without it I could see Alamar, but not strike him. Hear what I have seen. Alamar is not a king. He is Sheltem, a guardian the Ancients made to keep a world safe, who decided he knew better. He means to steer Xeen away from its sun and sail it like a ship. He came here in a pod from the stars. So did his pursuer, and that pod fell into lava in the Forbidden Zone. I have cooled it. Go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1191
msgid ""
"You found your way up my pyramid without my orb? I admire the effort and regret the result. Bring it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1194
msgid "Chosen Ones"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1196
msgid ""
"Olympus. Soul Storage. One box. Do not open the others' doors; the gods are touchy about their storage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1199
msgid ""
"Corak is awake. Then the prophecy is not a poem after all. You are the Chosen Ones: I say so, and the gods of Olympus will let you in on my word. Here is my pass. Lucio's boats sail from the jetties at Castleview and Sandcaster, and from Lakeside's dock. In Olympus is the only Soul Box left on Xeen. Corak needs it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1212
msgid "The boats"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1214
msgid ""
"Chosen Ones ride free, the Pharaoh says. He doesn't pay for the boats, mind. Up we go: Castleview's jetty, Sandcaster's, or Lakeside's dock, twice a week, and the clouds do the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1217
msgid ""
"My boats sail the sky, friends, and only for those the Dragon Pharaoh has chosen. Come back with his word and I'll take you up to Olympus."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1220
msgid "Prince Roland"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1221
msgid ""
"Prince Roland is held by Alamar in the bottom level of the Castle. Alive, after a fashion. Alamar keeps things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:74 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1224
msgid "Soul Box"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1226
msgid "(The box is quiet. Something inside it is being very patient.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1231
msgid ""
"Ah! A Soulbox! You have done well. I will hide in the box while you take me to Sheltem. Once you are in his presence, throw the box to the ground and I will come out and fight him. Be careful. If you lose the box or are killed, Xeen is doomed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1241
msgid ""
"I cannot leave the safety of this ship without some means of hiding from Sheltem's defenses. The Ancients made Soul Boxes for such things. The Pharaoh will know where one is left."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1244
msgid "Sheltem"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1245
msgid ""
"Much has happened since I crashed on Darkside. Sheltem left his stasis long before I did and has done much evil. My instruments show Xeen drifting out of its orbit: he has full control of it. I have orders to stop him, and I cannot, unless he does not see me coming."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1253
msgid ""
"Ah! You warm my reptilian heart. Sheltem is gone, and the wicked 'Lord Xeen' creation with him. Keep the Cube and the Scepter together. The destiny of Xeen is in sight, and I will need you for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1256
msgid ""
"It is good to see you again, Chosen Ones. Xeen is returning to its proper orbit. But Sheltem's general, the monster that calls himself 'Lord Xeen' on the other side of the world, still lives and holds the Scepter of Temporal Distortion. Rid the world of him, in his cloud castle above Darzog's tower, and bring me the scepter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1264
msgid ""
"Thank you again. Castle Xeen is a cloud again. The court misses the mirror more than it misses my brother's double."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1269
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing Xeen from that foul spirit. It is a pity about the mirror, though. Your destiny lies on the darkside of Xeen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1274
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing Xeen from that foul spirit. It is a pity about the mirror, though. And my brother? If he lives, he is on the other side. Go to him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1281
msgid "The destiny of Xeen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1283
msgid ""
"Xeen is one world, and the sun is where it belongs. I have nothing left to ask of you, Chosen Ones. That has not happened to me in a very long time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1287
msgid ""
"The machines at the corners of the other side, the four sleepers on this side, Roland in Sheltem's dungeon, the cloud above Darkstone Tower. Then the Cube and the Scepter, together, at my shrine. Rest where you can."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1290
msgid ""
"Now, with the Cube and the Scepter in hand and the enemies of the world out of the way, the destiny of Xeen is in sight. Turn on the four machines in the corners of the other side of the world. Awaken the elemental sleepers on this side. Open the way to the cloud world above Darkstone Tower: Prince Roland and Queen Kalindra are getting married there. Oh, that reminds me. Have you rescued Prince Roland from the bottom of Sheltem's dungeon yet? If you haven't, that's one more little detail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1300
msgid "The sleepers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1301
msgid ""
"Each sleeper lies on its own plane, and the planes hang below the Skyroads. Stand at a corner of the roads and the sky asks what you seek. Name the element: Fire in the north-west, Air in the north-east, Earth in the south-east, Water in the south-west. Then step off. The sleepers wake only for the Chosen Ones, and only when the Reflectors are humming."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1308
msgid "My brother"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1309
msgid ""
"My brother is home. The real one, this time; he eats. He tells me there is to be a wedding on a cloud, to a queen I have never met. Go and make sure it happens, Crusaders. I am too old to be surprised twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:84 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1315
msgid "Chime of Opening"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1317
msgid ""
"Nice to see you again, adventurers! The widget that you brought to me is fascinating! I turn it over every morning. It still does nothing. Marvellous."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1321
msgid ""
"Really? You have one? A widget! Then the Chime of Opening is yours. Make it so!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1329
msgid ""
"So you've come to me for the Chime of Opening. What could you possibly offer me in exchange? I've been around for thousands of years and I've seen everything... well, almost everything. There is one mysterious item that I haven't seen. It's called a widget. Go and see Halon the Inventor, who lives just north of Darkstone Tower. He's the one who first told me of it. Then don't come back 'til you find one!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1334
msgid ""
"Take the Last Flower of Summer to the Autumn Druid on the savannah, so that summer can end."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1337
msgid ""
"I am the Summer Druid. Summer will not end until someone carries its last flower away. Take it to the Autumn Druid, on Burlock's savannah. The year is a relay, and I have held it long enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1343
msgid "Autumn"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1345
msgid "Please take the Last Fallen Leaf of Autumn to the Winter Druid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1349
msgid ""
"Thank you for the Last Flower of Summer. Here is the Last Fallen Leaf of Autumn. Take the Leaf to the Winter Druid so Winter can begin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1355
msgid ""
"I am the Autumn Druid. I require the Last Flower of Summer before I can give you the last fallen Leaf of Autumn. Without the last flower of summer I cannot make summer end."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1360
msgid ""
"Take the Snowflake to the Spring Druid by Pitchfork Creek. He has waited all winter. He always does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1364
msgid ""
"The last leaf. Then winter may begin. Here is the last Snowflake of Winter; carry it to the Spring Druid, by Pitchfork Creek in Vertigo's meadows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1370
msgid ""
"I am the Winter Druid. Bring me the last fallen Leaf of Autumn, or winter waits, and so does everything after it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1373
msgid "Spring"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1375
msgid ""
"Spring comes to those who wait. You did not wait; you walked. That works too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1379
msgid ""
"The last snowflake of Winter. Here is the Last Raindrop of Spring, and your reward. As I renew the year, so will I renew you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1388
msgid ""
"I require the last snowflake of Winter before I can give you the Last Raindrop of Spring and your reward. The Summer Druid begins the year, in the west."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1391
msgid "Pendant"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1393
msgid ""
"The fountain runs again and the tavern charges for water again. Rivercity is back to normal. I'm not sure that's a compliment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1397
msgid ""
"Thank you for returning my pendant. Please accept the Enchant Item spell as your reward. I will also return the drinking fountain to normal. And the spellcasters among you have earned a better title than 'that lot with the pendant'."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1410
msgid "No pendant, no reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1413
msgid ""
"The sorceresses of Rivercity have stolen a magical pendant of mine. I want it back, and I will reward you if you return it. They keep their loot in a strongbox on the south quay, outside their house."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1417
msgid "Barok"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1418
msgid ""
"The tavern hired the sorceresses to run Barok out of town. Then they plugged the fountain, so now we buy our water here. Funny how that works."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1424
msgid "Tiara"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1426
msgid "It is always exhilarating to see adventurers such as yourselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1430
msgid ""
"You have recovered my tiara and gotten rid of that bothersome robber gang. I am pleased. As a reward I give you this treasure: its twin, which I never liked as much. And the thieves among you will be called Rogues from today. I'll have it written down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1443
msgid "I see that you have not recovered my tiara. Please keep trying."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1446
msgid ""
"My servants have informed me that my diamond tiara has been stolen from my room. I believe it to be the work of robbers that dwell in Rivercity, under the great bridge. They are led by a devious and cunning boss. They must be stopped and my tiara recovered. Do this and you will be greatly rewarded."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1450
msgid "The Pagoda"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1452
msgid ""
"The pagoda is quiet again. I sweep it every morning. The ninjas never swept. Someone lives in the cellar, though. I leave rice by the shrine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1456
msgid ""
"You have destroyed the Ninja Clan that drove me from my sacred home. I am eternally grateful. As payment for your services, please let me fill your packs with food. And those of you who walk the monk's road: you have walked it far enough to be called Initiates."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1468
msgid ""
"There are still Ninja in my Pagoda. I cannot go home until they are gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1471
msgid ""
"I am a peace loving old monk driven from my sacred home. I used to live in the Pagoda due south from here until the Evil Ninja clan drove me out. I am too old to fight, but perhaps you, being so strong and well-armed, could rid my home of these evil clansmen. I could reward you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1475
msgid "Initiation"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1476
msgid ""
"A monk who has not been initiated? Sit. Breathe. Stand up. That's all it is, really. The rest you already did."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1485
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving us! Eve hasn't hissed in a week. I've started to miss it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1489
msgid ""
"The curse is over. People are walking out of the cellars on two legs. Here: the town collected this for you. Some of it was in snakeskins."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1497
msgid ""
"Still snakes. Eve says the stones round the well have something to say. Eve says a lot of things now, and all of them with an s."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1500
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened to Asp. A foul curse has been placed on the town that turns people into snakes. Please save us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1504 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:195 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:216
msgid "Transformer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1506
msgid "The curse is over! Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1509
msgid ""
"There isss a transformer somewhere under town that is turning people into snakes. If you destroy it, the curse will surely end. The ssstones round the well open the way: start with the south-west stone, make it red, then every other one red all the way round."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1515
msgid "Always a pleasure to see you, Ghostslayers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1519
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You have finally rid Winterkill of all the spirits. As a reward, I dub thee Ghostslayers Extraordinaire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1531
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've successfully driven out the Polter Fool spirits, but now the spirits of Ghost Riders have moved in. Perhaps you could drive them out as well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1539
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've successfully driven out the Spirit Bones, but now the spirits of Polter Fools have moved in. Perhaps you could drive them out as well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1547
msgid ""
"You haven't driven the spirits from Winterkill yet. Keep trying. And bang the southern gong when you have: it's the only way I hear anything out here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1550
msgid ""
"The people of this fair city were driven out by a curse that brought the spirits of the dead back to life. The town is currently haunted by Spirit Bones. Perhaps you could drive them out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1555
msgid "The Count"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1557
msgid ""
"Draco is gone. The town breathes. Well, the town does. I never took it up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1560
msgid ""
"Draco? A boor. He sleeps in the square in a box with his name on it, and he bites the customers. If the dials were set right and his lid came off at night, I would not stand in your way. I would not stand anywhere near it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1564
msgid ""
"With Draco gone, someone must be the elder of this town's night. You'll do. Rise, Nosferatu."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1571
msgid "My master"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1573
msgid ""
"The Sphinx lies east of here, out in the dunes. It asks its own name. Its name is Golux. Master always said it was cheating to know that, so of course he knew."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1577
msgid ""
"His Scroll of Insight! He would say thank you. He would also say not to read it upside down, which is how he read it. Take his amulet: the Northern Sphinx opens to it. He never had the nerve to go in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1587
msgid "Third floor. Mind the dogs. They are not dogs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1590
msgid ""
"The wizards of Castle Basenji killed my master and took his Scroll of Insight. They keep werewolves. Here is his note; he wrote everything down, including what he shouldn't have. The second floor's door wants 'There wolf'. Bring the scroll back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1595
msgid "Scarab"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1597
msgid ""
"The spell is finished. The gargoyles haven't been back. I like to think they heard what happened to the last ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1601
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you so much for recovering my Scarab. Now I can complete my spell. Take this; I was keeping it for whoever was brave enough. And the healers and druids among you: kneel. You have earned more than a trinket. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1614
msgid ""
"I see you haven't recovered my Scarab of Imaging yet. Remember that the gargoyles took it to their eyrie on the Gargoyle Range, north of here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1617
msgid ""
"The other day I was using my Scarab of Imaging for one of my spells when out of the sky swooped a flock of gargoyles. While I was busy fending off their attack, one of them snatched my Scarab and they all flew off toward the Gargoyle Range. I know not why they took it, only that gargoyles are hired to steal things for people. I need the Scarab back to complete my spell, and I will reward you if you can return it to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1623
msgid ""
"Carlawna is my sister, by the way. She never tells anyone. I tell everyone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1627
msgid ""
"Thank the Gods! You've recovered the crystals. You are truly great adventurers. As a reward, take this. A wizard's house is full of things a wizard has stopped using."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1637
msgid ""
"You haven't brought me my Crystals of Piezoelectricity. Perhaps they are in Asp."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1640
msgid ""
"This region is in a lot of danger. First, my sister Carlawna's Scarab of Imaging was stolen, and now my Crystals of Piezoelectricity have been taken. Last night I remembered a story told to me as a boy about a strange machine that produced reptile creatures. This machine could be powered by using Crystals of Piezoelectricity and a Scarab of Imaging. I never gave much validity to the story because a mad wizard told it to me, but now I can't help but think it's true. Get my Crystals back and there will be a reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1646
msgid "The sea's cold and the fish are rude. I've never been happier."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1650
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for getting me the elixir! Now I can be restored to my former self and return to my ocean home. As a reward, I blow my kiss to all of you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1660
msgid ""
"I'm waiting for you to bring me the elixir of restoration from the evil clerics."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1663
msgid ""
"I was once a beautiful mermaid. But one day a sorceress saw me swimming and became jealous of my beauty. She cast a spell that took away my beauty, but worst of all she took away my mermaid tail and gave me legs instead. I search to find an elixir of restoration so I can return to the way I once was. I've heard the clerics of the evil Temple of Yak, in the dark south end of the fairy woods below Rivercity, have one. If you could retrieve this elixir for me I would be eternally grateful. Take this stone to gain entrance to the temple."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1668
msgid "Lake beasts"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1670
msgid ""
"My friends, I am always glad to see you. The fish are back, and so am I. My boat's at the jetty if you want the island."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1674
msgid ""
"You have slain the monsters of the lake! Here, I insist you take this as a token of my appreciation. And my boat is yours whenever you want the island."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1684
msgid ""
"The beasts still live. I wish someone would kill them. Three of them, big as barns. I'd not go near them without a great deal of practice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1687
msgid ""
"The fish supply is low. I am sure some sort of lake beasts are eating all the fish. If you kill the beasts, I will be indebted to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1691
msgid "Water clock"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1693
msgid ""
"It is wonderful to see my clock work year round. But still, one can never have enough time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1697
msgid ""
"Lava! Great! You can't imagine how much time you have saved me. Take this widget as payment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1707
msgid ""
"You don't have the lava! Why are you standing around wasting time when you could be out looking for lava?!?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1710
msgid ""
"I am Halon the Efficient. I have moved here from Rivercity to avoid the timewasters that place is full of. To help me keep track of time I have constructed a massive water clock, but the water freezes every winter. If I had some magical lava from Mount Firestone, I could melt the ice in the clock. Bring me some lava and I will reward you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1714 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4004
msgid "Trolls"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1716
msgid "You are welcome to converse with us anytime, civilized ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1720
msgid ""
"Thank you for killing the trolls, civilized ones. Your speedy job has saved us many lives and much discomfort. A cousin of mine on the dark side of the world, Leafpoint, will want to meet you. Take this. It grew in my roots for a century; we have no use for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1729
msgid ""
"The Trolls are not dead yet. It is most urgent that you kill them. If you could please have them all dead by the end of the decade, we may give you a greater reward for rushing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1732
msgid ""
"It is good to see some civilized people around here. Maybe you will kill the Trolls for us. They gnaw on our bark to sharpen their teeth in a most uncivilized fashion. Friends don't gnaw on friend's bark. We have talked about this for a couple of centuries, give or take a few decades, and have decided to hire some civilized people. Their warren is in the forest behind me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1736
msgid "Cyclopes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1738
msgid "Friends, you are always welcome here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1742
msgid ""
"We saw the Cyclops' outpost burning in the distance. You have our eternal thanks. Songs will be sung in your honor for generations to come. Here, take these treasures. We know it isn't much, but it is all we have to give."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1752
msgid ""
"Every day the casualties increase. Find the cyclops as soon as you can. We are dying."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1755
msgid ""
"Oh mighty heroes, your fame precedes you. Recently, a group of cyclops established an outpost near our lands, in the Land of the Giants to the south-west. They are cruel monsters that eat anyone they can catch. Please destroy them for us. We will give you what we can in return for your help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1761
msgid ""
"The forest is quiet again. The sprites are merely rude now, which for sprites is peace."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1765
msgid ""
"You have returned my Wand of Faery Magic! Now peace can be restored to the forest. Please accept this gold as a reward. And any of you with elven blood in the dark: kneel. The wand remembers its own."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1776
msgid "The Sprites still possess my Wand. Try harder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1779
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened. My Wand of Faery Magic has been stolen by the Sprites. Without the Wand in my possession, my powers of magic are reduced. Now that the Sprites possess my Wand they are crazed with power, attacking anyone in the forest. If you return my Wand I will reward you handsomely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1784
msgid "Elven blood in the dark, and the wand remembers it. Rise, Patriarch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1791
msgid "Holy Book"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1793
msgid ""
"The Book is home. Whenever you are ready, I will teach you the Spirit as a Master knows it. I owe you that much."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1797
msgid ""
"You have recovered the Holy Book of Elvenkind! The entire Elf kingdom thanks you. Please accept this gold as a reward. And ask me about the Spirit: I can teach it to the rank of Master."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1807
msgid ""
"I see you haven't found the Holy Book of Elvenkind. Please keep looking."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1810
msgid ""
"While travelling through Troll forest recently, I was ambushed. In my haste to escape I dropped the Holy Book of Elvenkind. I can only hope that it has not been found, for if it happens to fall into the wrong hands it could lead to the extinction of my entire race. I will reward you well if you can return it to me. The Troll Forest is far to the south-west, in the snows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1816
msgid ""
"My skull! Thank you! Already I can feel my tie to this world fading. Listen to the sound of the surf for your spell. (A book washes up at your feet: Recharge Item.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1828
msgid ""
"I see you don't have my skull yet. Well, that's ok. I've been here for a very long time. I don't mind another century or so. Don't worry about me. I'll just keep washing up on the shore here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1831
msgid ""
"I hate the surf. I have been trapped here since I died, crashing forward and pulling back, forward and back. I am sick of it. If you bring my skull and cast it into the surf here, I will be set free. I think my skull was pulled by the currents to the south and lies near the edge of the world. Retrieve my skull and I will teach you a spell before I go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1838
msgid "Warning"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1839
msgid ""
"You came! Up here a spirit hears things. Alamar is not his name. Read the plaques of this city before you go to his castle, and do not go without a way to hide what you carry from him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1845
msgid "Whistle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1847
msgid ""
"The statues are awake. Each holds a book for the first caster who comes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1851
msgid "The Whistle! Thank you. I'll activate the statues now. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1860
msgid ""
"No luck finding the whistle? Well, if you find it be sure to bring it back to me. I'm sure I dropped it somewhere in Pitchfork Creek."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1863
msgid ""
"A couple of years ago I built a statue on each of the two islands near here. The statues are supposed to teach spellcasters the cure poison and cure disease spells, but I lost the bone whistle needed to activate them. I think I dropped it somewhere in Pitchfork Creek. If you can find my whistle I will activate the statues."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1867
msgid "Phirna root"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1869 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1883
msgid "Thanks for the ingredients. I'll make a batch right away."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1893
msgid "What, no Phirna root? I can't make you any potions without the root."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1896
msgid ""
"Toad meadow is the only known source of Phirna root, a vital ingredient in antidote potions. The witches of the meadow have been turning everyone they find into toads, so I don't dare go there. I will give you five potions for each Phirna root you bring me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1900
msgid "Celia"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1902
msgid ""
"No zombies down here. Gremlins, cobras, the odd hornet. Celia says it's an improvement."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1906
msgid "We are to be married. Somewhere with fewer zombies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1910
msgid ""
"You have rescued my Celia! I am so grateful to you for reuniting us. As payment for your services, please accept this treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1920
msgid "You have not rescued Celia from the zombies yet. Please hurry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1923
msgid ""
"I am searching for my intended bride, Celia. She was tending her family's sheep when zombies snatched her and disappeared into the Forest of the Walking Dead. The forest is so large and the zombies so many I'll need help to rescue her before they turn her into one of them. Help me, please."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1927
msgid "Untie"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1928
msgid ""
"You cut the ropes. \"Derek sent you? Bless him. I'll find my own way to his camp, zombies or no zombies.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1936 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3444
msgid "The sword"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1937
msgid ""
"Derek found this on the road down. It's too good a sword for a man who mostly carries firewood, I told him, and the people who carried me out of a zombie wood should have it. Take it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1945 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2609
msgid "Ogres"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1947
msgid ""
"Not a boulder in a month! The boats run upriver again, and my crews have stopped flinching at loud noises. Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1951
msgid ""
"Thank you for getting rid of the Ogres. Here is your reward. The upriver run opens tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1960
msgid ""
"The Ogres aren't gone yet. I think their base of operation is in the hills to the Northwest of here, up the north river."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1963
msgid ""
"Those Ogres are ruining me! For months they have been throwing boulders at the boats that ply the waters around here. Three of my ships have gone to the bottom in as many months because the Ogres like the sound of crunching wood and screaming men. I want those Ogres gone and I am willing to pay well for the service."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1967
msgid "Joe's map"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1968
msgid ""
"You bought one of Joe's treasure maps?!? Hahahahaha! Sorry. Here, let me give you a REAL treasure map. I'm too old to chase after treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1980 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2008
msgid "Treasure map"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1982
msgid ""
"You already have the only one of its kind. Two would be greedy, and it would make the first one less unique."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1986
msgid ""
"Friend, have I got a deal for you! Only 1000 gold for this secret treasure map, discovered during my travels on Darkside. Only one of its kind! (Behind him stands a crate of them.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1994
msgid ""
"Another one? Only one of its kind, friend, and still 1000 gold. Come back when your purse agrees."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1997
msgid ""
"Treasure maps! Genuine! Only one of its kind, 1000 gold. (Joe looks at your purse and loses interest.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2001 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3292 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:440
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:449 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:455 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:824
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:830 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:655
msgid "Vertigo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2002
msgid ""
"Vertigo? Never heard of it. Different Joe. I'm in maps now. Maps don't breed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2010
msgid ""
"The map was interesting. The thing at the end of it was more interesting. You don't get to know what it was."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2014
msgid ""
"You dug it up yourselves? Then you have a hole and no map. I have neither. We're even."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2018
msgid ""
"A treasure map. Hmmm. Perhaps it leads to something interesting, perhaps not. I am willing to look, whereas you don't really have the time, do you? I'll give you 4,000 gold for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2024
msgid "I am Slibo. I collect maps, and the things at the end of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2027
msgid "The tax"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2029
msgid ""
"Paid in full. Keep the receipt. The dragons inside don't ask for it, but they do eat people who argue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2033
msgid ""
"Two thousand gold and twenty gems. Thank you. ... Receipt. Proceed. Mind the dragons; they are exempt from manners."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2040
msgid ""
"Everyone who enters the Dragon Cave pays the dragon tax: two thousand gold and twenty gems. No gems, no entry. No exceptions. I was an exception once. Never again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2045
msgid ""
"A dragon who pays tax and reads. Rarer than gold. The last lesson costs the most, and you have paid it. Rise, Great Wyrm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2053
msgid ""
"Another dragon who reads? The office is becoming a library. Rise, Great Wyrm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2057
msgid ""
"Great Wyrms are made of dragons, and you have none with you. Paperwork does not stretch that far."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2063 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3496 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3588
msgid "Gremlins"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2065
msgid "Castleview likes you! Visit anytime!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2069
msgid ""
"You have saved Castleview from the wicked Gremlins! Oh, frabjous day! Here is your gold, and a pass, so the gate stops arguing with you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2079
msgid "The Gremlins' reign of terror persists. No gold for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2082
msgid ""
"I am the mouthpiece of Castleview. The treasury will pay well for ending the Gremlins' mischief in town. Their king, Gettlewaithe, holds court in a burrow under our wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2087
msgid "Gettlewaithe's gift"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2088
msgid ""
"This came from the burrow this morning, with a note: 'For the delegation. Sir.' Three Energy Disks. I believe that is a gremlin apology. Take them before they explode."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2098 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2703
msgid "We come in peace"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2100 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2130
msgid "I am always at your service, sir."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2104
msgid "Yes, yes, you live. What else?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2107
msgid ""
"Excellent. Your display of respect has earned you your lives. What have you come to petition me for?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2111
msgid "The Mayor's demand"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2117
msgid "I am not interested in hearing from the butts of our jokes. Begone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2121
msgid ""
"Well, um, perhaps I can do something about those naughty, naughty pranksters. We can still talk about this like rational beings, can't we?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2124
msgid ""
"The answer is no! You will now suffer the consequences of your audacity. Guards!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2128
msgid "Submit or die"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2134
msgid ""
"Yes, sir. I will do as you ask without delay. The sewers, the bridges, the mill. All of it. Sir."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2141
msgid "I see. Guards! Remove this rabble from my court!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2145
msgid "(yawn) Off with their heads."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2151
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, friends! Remember, if you ever want to know anything about maps, just come to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2155
msgid ""
"Thank you for freeing my brother! Here's a little money for your trouble. If you ever want to know anything about maps, just come to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2163
msgid ""
"My brother still languishes in the town jail. I hope it's not too much to ask for you to hurry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2166
msgid ""
"I'm Jethro, brother of Jasper. Jasper is in Castleview jail, falsely accused of stealing a treasure map from Joe, the treasure map salesman. Joe is a crook, but I can't prove it. Maybe you could break Jasper out. I'm not strong enough to do it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2173
msgid "Jasper's gone. Less paperwork. I'm not asking how."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2177
msgid ""
"Let me see that. A map of nowhere, in Joe's hand, signed 'genuine'. For a thousand gold? Jasper didn't steal this, nobody would. He's free to go. Don't tell Joe I can read."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2182
msgid ""
"Jasper stole a map from Joe. Joe says so, and Joe is very convincing. Bring me proof otherwise, or bring me a nap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2187
msgid "Thanks for freeing me! I knew Jethro would find help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2190
msgid ""
"Joe sold the fake maps. I drew the real ones. Guess which of us is in jail. The back window's bars are older than the warden."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2193 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2204 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2217
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2230
msgid "Lesson"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2195
msgid "Learned you have. Hannah Sister to go, now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2198
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: No word, no bond, row on. Now do I repay a period won. Go, now, and visit Sister Hannah for more enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2206
msgid "Learned you have. Bob Brother to go, now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2210
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: Oh who was it I saw, oh who? He lived as a devil, eh? Go, now, and visit Brother Bob for more enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2227 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2245
msgid "Order wrong the. Otto first, Brother. Lesson one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2219
msgid "Learned you have. Ada Sister to go, now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2223
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: Eva, can I stab bats in a cave? Was it a rat I saw? Go, now, and visit Sister Ada for more enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2232
msgid "Drawkcab a are you. Reger Brother see. The word say: palindrome."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2236
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Live on time; emit no evil. Lepers repel. Congratulations! I dub thee a member of the Drawkcab! We study the palindrome, the word that reads the same both ways. Brother Reger, outside the walls, will ask you for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2248
msgid "The word"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2250
msgid "Pleased to see you, fellow Drawkcabs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2254
msgid ""
"Correct. You are truly a Drawkcab! Those of you who walk the inner way walk it now as Masters. Backwards, naturally."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2262
msgid ""
"Correct. A Drawkcab truly are you. Masters, though, ready not yet are you. Return when the Queen's castle stands higher."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2266
msgid ""
"There is a word for what the monks of Castleview study. Say it at my door, not in my ear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2269
msgid ""
"Wrong. Go visit the monks of Castleview for enlightenment and return to me when you feel you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2272
msgid "The chests"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2274
msgid ""
"To close all of the chests is quite an accomplishment, but to open them requires intellect most uncommon. Don't try. I just got them shut."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2278
msgid ""
"Every lid down, in order. Quite an accomplishment. Here: a few things people stored and never came back for."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2288
msgid "Half the chests. Half an accomplishment. I don't pay in halves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2291
msgid ""
"Public Storage: put things in, take things out, in the right order. Close every chest. The numbers count themselves, one to nine. The letters spell something you'd find in a barn: PITCHFORK."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2296
msgid "Rats"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2298
msgid "It's good to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2302
msgid ""
"You've killed the Queen Rat! Here is your reward: my chest. Go on, open it. It's yours. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2307
msgid ""
"The Queen Rat is still alive. I can hear her awful chittering through the walls. No reward for you yet!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2310
msgid ""
"Hi. I live down here. There sure are a lot of rats. Too many for me to kill. Maybe you could kill the Queen Rat for me. I'll give you something if you do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2315
msgid "Heretics"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2317
msgid "It is always pleasing to be honored with your presence, my friends."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2321
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help in the battle against the heretics. Ours is the true religion, and Mok has sided with the righteous. Those of you who serve the light, Mok raises up; the rest of you get gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2332
msgid ""
"My door is open, but the Cult Leader still preaches on the top floor. Mok does not share a tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2336
msgid ""
"You went up their rope? Good. The key to my door is on the top floor, by their altar. Bring it down and let me in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2340
msgid ""
"Your failure to breach the tower is not your fault; it is a test of my determination to cleanse the faith of heresy. I implore you to continue your efforts on my behalf."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2343
msgid ""
"Oh, wretched fortune! I, Dreyfus, high priest of Mok, have been cast from my tower by heretics in the priesthood! They warded the door against me, but they still haul their bread up a rope on the north wall. Perhaps you could climb in from the top and open the tower to me again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2348
msgid "The clerics"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2349
msgid ""
"Humble and Pious came to me and begged forgiveness. I gave them the latrines. Mok is merciful; I am thorough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2355
msgid "Ruby work"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2357
msgid ""
"Five ruby rocks and two gems. Give me an hour. There. Ruby. Mind the edge."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2368
msgid "The rocks are fine. The fee is two gems, and you have the rocks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2371
msgid ""
"With 5 Ruby rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 2 gems. The rocks are in the Gemstone Mines; I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Ruby rocks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2376
msgid "Emerald work"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2378
msgid ""
"Five emerald rocks and four gems. Emerald steel never dulls. Neither does my invoice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2389
msgid "Rocks, yes. Gems, no. Four gems."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2392
msgid ""
"With 5 Emerald rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 4 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Emerald rocks. Come back when you do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2397
msgid "Sapphire work"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2399
msgid ""
"Five sapphire rocks, six gems. Sapphire keeps you cool under fire. Literally. Don't test it on me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2410
msgid "Six gems. Then we talk sapphire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2413
msgid ""
"With 5 Sapphire rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 6 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Sapphire rocks. Come back when you do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2418
msgid "Diamond work"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2420
msgid "Five diamonds, ten gems. Diamonds are forever. So was the wait. Here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2431
msgid "Ten gems. Diamonds don't cut themselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2434
msgid ""
"With 5 diamonds I can make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 10 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough diamonds. Come back when you do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2439
msgid "Emerald handle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2441
msgid "Retirement suits me. I sit, I read, I do not look for handles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2445
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! You've found the emerald handle. I'll give you this pass to Sandcaster. And the staff. I fixed it, cast one spell to prove I still could, and retired. Take it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2455
msgid ""
"You haven't found my staff's emerald handle yet. Keep searching. I can reward you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2458
msgid ""
"I seem to have lost the emerald handle that fits on the end of my magical staff. It must have come off on my journey back from visiting Sandcaster. Find it, and I'll get you into the city."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2463
msgid "Monga melons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2465
msgid ""
"Hi! Glad to see you again. I saved the seeds from the Monga Melons you gave me, and now I'm growing my own! (He eats yours anyway.) (sigh) I love Monga Melons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2470
msgid ""
"Hi! Glad to see you again. I'm growing my own melons now. (sigh) I love Monga Melons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2474
msgid ""
"Well, it's about time! I practically starved to death waiting for you to return with my Monga Melons. Yum. Here's the key I promised you: the Temple of Bark, in the heart of the forest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2485
msgid ""
"You didn't bring me enough Monga Melons. I'm practically starving to death. Of all the rotten things to do to a poor monkeydog. Three!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2488
msgid ""
"There is nothing in this world that I love more than Monga Melons. The sweetest grow in the southern meadowlands, home of the most vicious centipedes. Bring me three, and I'll give you a key you'll want."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2493
msgid "Sheewana"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2495
msgid ""
"We are always pleased to see heroes such as yourselves. You are welcome in our forest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2499
msgid ""
"Thank you! It is good to see her back. Here is your reward. And those of you who hunt: the forest has taught you all it can. Walk it now as its lords."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2508
msgid ""
"Thank you! It is good to see her back. Here is your reward: two Energy Disks and a LOT of gold, as agreed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2516
msgid ""
"You have not rescued her yet. Keep trying. We think she was taken by the Orcs into the Temple of Bark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2519
msgid ""
"I am Sharla, First of the Sprites. We have a problem. The Orcs have kidnapped one of our sisters. Can you help her?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2524
msgid "Certainly"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2525
msgid "Thank you so much! Go to the Temple of Bark and free her!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2532
msgid "What's in it for us?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2533
msgid ""
"We have two Energy Disks and some gold to give you after you rescue her. A LOT of gold? Very well. A lot. Go to the Temple of Bark and free her!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2540
msgid "This is a stick up!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2541
msgid "Sisters, we are under attack! Stop them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2548
msgid "Home"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2550
msgid "Take me home. Oh, you did. How proper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2554
msgid ""
"Thank you for freeing me. I will return now to my sisters and tell them of your heroic deed!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2562
msgid ""
"You came for me? Oh, how proper. The cage is locked, and Shaalth keeps the key on his belt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2567
msgid "Orcs can't jump. Remember that, and their ledges are yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2570
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing me from these foul orcs. Remember, Orcs can't jump."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2578
msgid ""
"The sun! Somewhere up there. I'm going to go and look at it for a week."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2581
msgid "Thank you for saving me. I haven't seen the sun in days!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2589
msgid "Snog not do evil. Snog not go back in cell either."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2592
msgid ""
"The rest of the Orcs imprisoned me for refusing to do evil. Thanks for getting me out of there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2600
msgid "Don't drink the Shaman's tea. I mean it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2603
msgid "The Orc Shaman tells lies, and his tea is poisonous. Watch yourself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2611
msgid "The caravans run through Ogre Pass on time. Nearly on time. On a day."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2615
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for getting rid of the Ogres! My caravans can now get through the pass safely. Here, take this gold as a reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2623
msgid "There are still Ogres attacking my caravans. Please do something!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2626
msgid ""
"These blasted Ogres are killing my business. Every time I try to get a caravan through Ogre Pass they attack it, stealing everything. Get rid of them for me. There is a reward, and a bounty if both their forts burn."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2632
msgid ""
"Two forts, burned to the ground. The bounty, as promised. And those of you who hunt for pay: the caravan guild has a title for hunters like you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2643
msgid "Gifts"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2645
msgid ""
"We accept gift and won't pull your arms out of sockets today. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2651
msgid "Gift is gold. You have no gold. Why you talk?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2657
msgid "Pharaoh's oath"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2658
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh is chief of nothing, now. Alamar is chief. We work for Alamar. We pull your arms out of socket now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2665
msgid "Bow low, slave!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2666
msgid "Har Har Har! We LIKE! You make big laugh! You friends. What you need?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2674 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2725
msgid "Energy disks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2676
msgid "We have no more energy disks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2679
msgid ""
"We are Ogres! We take what we want. Yesterday, we took the Sardaj's Energy disks! (grunt) Here are two energy disks. Caravans? Fine. We let caravans pass. Boring, but fine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2689 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3308
msgid "Orcs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2690
msgid ""
"The Orcs captured a sprite a little while ago... Har! (snort) Har! They sacrifice them to their God sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2697
msgid ""
"We didn't know you fight against Alamar. He pay us much gold to be on his side. Because we like you, we pretend you didn't say that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2704
msgid ""
"I am Yog, chief of the Sardaj tribe. You do not come for battle? Then you are welcome among us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2715
msgid "Battle!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2716
msgid "Then you shall not leave these lands alive!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2726
msgid ""
"We would gladly give energy disks to you if we had them, but the Ogres stole the only ones we owned."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2732
msgid "Help against Alamar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2734
msgid ""
"You are welcome among us, friend. The giants of the desert are our friends too. Tell Gurodel that Yog sent you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2737
msgid ""
"We will fill your packs with food so that your journey will be without hunger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2745
msgid "Give gold"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2747
msgid ""
"Hobstadt wants all. You give two thousand. Hobstadt cannot count past two thousand. Good. Go where you like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2752
msgid "That is not all. That is not anything. Give gold, give one, or fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2758
msgid "Sacrifice one"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2760
msgid ""
"Troll in your party. Hobstadt take him. One night. (Morning. Your troll comes back taller, with new scars and no regrets.) Now he is War Troll. You are friends of Hobstadt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2765
msgid ""
"No troll. Hobstadt not eat your kind. Too many bones. Give gold, or fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2771
msgid "Fight to the death"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2772
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2779
msgid "Thieves' gold"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2780
msgid "Thief gold in back. Hobstadt not like thieves. Take."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2786
msgid "Xenoc and Morgana"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2788
msgid "I am pleased to see you! Sandcaster will not forget your great deeds!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2792
msgid ""
"Thank you. You have done both me and Sandcaster a great service. The quarter is open again. And those of you who walked their halls unseen: the guilds have a word for people like you. Spies. Good ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2801
msgid ""
"One of them is gone. The other is still on a guild throne, and twice as careful. Finish it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2805
msgid ""
"Every day that Sandcaster suffers under the rule of these evil masters is a day ill spent. Everyone is relying on you to put matters right."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2808
msgid ""
"Two years ago, Xenoc the Wizard and Morgana the Sorceress came to town with visions of conquest. They ruined my good name and made themselves heads of the guilds. Now I am dethroned, and the guilds are wicked. Will you help right the wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2812
msgid "We will help"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2813
msgid ""
"Good. I fear that it will be impossible to talk them from their lofty positions, so you will have to defeat them in battle. They hold the quarter behind the guild gate. Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2821
msgid "Not our affair"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2822
msgid ""
"I see. I had thought better of you. Perhaps you will change your minds after you talk to some of the townspeople and learn firsthand the evil these arrogant magicians have wrought."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2829
msgid "Magnifying glass"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2831
msgid "Always nice to see you! Come and look at this. No? It's very small."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2835
msgid ""
"How wonderful! You have located my magnifying glass. Can't thank you enough. Take this gold, and this: I made it, and now I can finally see what it is."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2845
msgid ""
"I see you didn't find my magnifying glass. You know, I did see a couple of gargoyles loitering around my tent the other day. Maybe they stole it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2848
msgid ""
"Well, this is just great! How am I supposed to get any work done? My magnifying glass is missing and I can't see what I'm working on without it. Do you think you could find it for me? Gargoyles were loitering around the tent. Gargoyles like shiny things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2853
msgid "The People"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2855
msgid ""
"The People remember their friends, little ones. Walk our hills as you like; mind where you step."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2858
msgid ""
"We are the People. We were here before Alamar, and we will be here after him. He wants to drive this world away from its sun, like a cart from a stable, and ride it home. The People do not want to be driven. What do you want of the People, little ones?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2861
msgid "Friendship"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2862
msgid ""
"Friendship. Good. That is a small word for small people, and a large one for us. Take these, little ones. Alamar's people dropped them in our hills, and they hum when we sleep."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2873
msgid "Your hall"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2874
msgid ""
"My hall? Then come and take it, little ones, if you can. The People will be waiting on the stair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2883
msgid ""
"I drink from it every morning. Water, mostly. I'm still alive, so it works."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2887
msgid ""
"You gave it back to those mumbling knights? I'll die of thirst before I die of poison. Get out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2891
msgid ""
"Oh, thank the Gods! You have the Chalice. For saving my life, I dub thee royal taste testers and give you this treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2905
msgid ""
"Please get the Chalice. I live in fear for my life. And remember: when the voice asks what you seek, answer the knights' way. No vowels. C, H, L, C."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2908
msgid ""
"Recently, my tribal seer told me I will die by drinking a poisoned drink. The royal Chalice of Protection neutralises any poison placed in it. The knights of the Northern Tower have it, and my efforts to steal it have been in vain. Here is the key to their tower. They leave the vowels out of everything they say; when their voice asks what you seek, answer it their way: Chlc. Bring me the Chalice and I will reward you well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2914
msgid "Jewel of Ages"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2916
msgid ""
"You can now come and drink here whenever you feel the effects of unnatural aging. The jewel keeps you; the water keeps everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2920
msgid ""
"You've found the Jewel of Ages! Let me dip it in the fountain. See: the waters remember it. Keep the jewel; the fountain only needed to see it once. Drink here whenever you feel the effects of unnatural aging."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2927
msgid ""
"Sold to the mages of the Eastern Tower, east of here by the rim. Mages don't steal. They acquire, and then they study. Go and interrupt them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2933
msgid ""
"Without the Jewel of Ages, I cannot restore the fountain. See if you can find a clue to its whereabouts in the Great Southern Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2936
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened. The Jewel of Ages has been stolen from its place in the fountain. Now the once youth-giving waters have turned back to venom. If you recover the jewel, I'll be able to restore the fountain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2940 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3716
msgid "Hornets"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2942
msgid ""
"Stung in the Aging Forest? Those hornets don't take blood, they take years. Drink from the fountain and have them back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2945
msgid ""
"Stay out from under the great oak. Its hornets don't take blood, they take years. My fountain used to give them back. Now it is venom, like everything else round here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2948
msgid "Ellinger's letter"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2949
msgid ""
"Ellinger's seal. 'To the Guildmaster of Sandcaster: the bearer has earned the robes of an Archmage.' Ellinger never wrote that about anyone. Those of you in a Wizard's robe, take these instead. The rest of you may hold the letter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2958 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d2.lua:345
msgid "Southern Tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2960
msgid ""
"Thieves who keep accounts. The world is full of surprises, most of them bad."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2964
msgid ""
"Sold to the mages of the Eastern Tower? Then that is where my jewel is. And where Luna's statuettes went, she should hear. Thank you. Take this for the trouble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2972
msgid ""
"The Great Southern Tower is in Sprite Forest, rumored to be a hideout for thieves. Thieves write things down. Look for that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2975
msgid ""
"A thief dropped this in his haste to escape: the key to the Great Southern Tower. It is the only help I can offer. Whoever took the Jewel of Ages went there first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2980
msgid "Inner circle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2982
msgid ""
"You got past the gongs, the chest and my accountants. Rogues and marksmen that good are wasted on heroics. Join the inner circle. No paperwork. Well, a ledger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2987
msgid ""
"Nobody in your party has the hands for my trade. Take what you came for and go. Quietly. Thieves appreciate quiet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2993
msgid "Statuettes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2995
msgid "I'm pleased to see you again, friends. Please come by more often!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2999
msgid ""
"The Pegasus! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3008
msgid ""
"The Dragon! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3017
msgid ""
"The Griffin! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3026
msgid "All three are on the altar. Look at the altar, please, not at me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3030
msgid ""
"I see you haven't found all of the statuettes yet. The thieves sold them, I am sure of it. Thieves write down who buys."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3033
msgid ""
"Somehow the three golden statuettes that give my altar its magical aura have been stolen. Without it, I have no powers of healing. Start with the thieves of the Great Southern Tower; the keeper of the fountain near Venom Pond has a key."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3038
msgid "The altar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3039
msgid ""
"You have found all of my statuettes! Now I can restore the altar's magical aura and regain my powers of healing. For you, great adventurers, shall share my powers. Those of you who fight with bow and spell alike, rise as Master Archers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3047
msgid "The ring"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3049
msgid "Wear it in good health. It makes sure you have plenty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3053
msgid ""
"That's it. I took it off to split wood and the mountain kept it. You know, it never did fit me after I got it back the last time. Keep it. And take this for the climb."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3061
msgid ""
"The woodpile on Magic Mountain, by the wizards' camp. Third log, if I remember right. I never remember right."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3064
msgid ""
"I took my ring off to split wood up on Magic Mountain, and now it's somewhere in the woodpile. Fetch it and I'll make it worth the walk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3068 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3724
msgid "The coven"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3070
msgid ""
"Lakeside has its tavern back and I have my feet back. I keep checking on both."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3074
msgid ""
"The stocks fell open when the Head Witch died, and the others are out. Lakeside is ours again. The tavern was never destroyed, by the way. They only painted it gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3084
msgid ""
"The Head Witch is dead and my stocks fell open. I'm staying until the others are out of the cells. Someone has to count them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3088
msgid ""
"Four more of us are in the cells below the Guild, and the Head Witch above them. The Guild's door asks 'What am I?' The answer is witch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3091
msgid ""
"They put me in the stocks for failing the initiation test. The test is the riddle at the Guild's door, 'What am I?', and the answer is witch. I said 'broom'. Four more of us are in the cells below. The good ones go to Castle Blackfang as guards; the rejects go to the Isle. Get them out, and break the coven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3096
msgid "Necropolis pass"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3097
msgid ""
"Because they did this to me, I'll tell you where the Head Witch keeps her pass to Necropolis. It is in a chest in her room, in the north-west corner of the coven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3105
msgid ""
"Sandro was the finest of us. He cut out his own heart to cheat death, and now he cannot stop killing to stay as he is. He lives in the sewer under us. A Priest or a Wizard who asked him nicely, before the end, might learn how it was done. I have never been that nice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3109
msgid ""
"Falista says to tell you: \"I, Falista, grant all great adventurers the title of Crusader.\" Kneel, then. Knights rise as Cavaliers, Paladins as Crusaders, Rangers as Hunters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3117
msgid ""
"Another spellcaster without a proper title? Stand there. Sorcerers rise as Wizards, Archers as Warrior Mages. Mind the fountain on your way out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3124
msgid "Ordination"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3125
msgid ""
"Another one who heals and hasn't been ordained? Kneel. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3132
msgid "The turning year"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3133
msgid ""
"Carlawna sent word that you helped her. Leaves fall so the tree can grow. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3140
msgid "Rogues"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3141
msgid ""
"Another thief in your company? How useful. Rise, Rogue. Don't touch anything on the way out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3148 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3424
msgid "The dungeon"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3150
msgid ""
"Another knight in your company. Kneel. ... Rise, Champion of the Darkside. That's the whole ceremony; we lost the trumpets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3155
msgid ""
"The cells are quiet. The guard can sleep in the guardroom again, instead of on the stairs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3159
msgid ""
"Quiet down there. Truly quiet. Those of you who ride and fight as knights: kneel. ... Rise, Champions of the Darkside. The rest of you: the Queen's thanks, and mine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3167
msgid ""
"The liches are still down there. You can hear them filing their nails. On the bars."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3170
msgid ""
"When the dungeon came back, so did the liches we locked up in it. We could cage them, never kill them. You could. Clear the cells, and I have a title for the knights among you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3177
msgid "The clan"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3179
msgid "Another one who walks quietly? Good. The clan has room."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3184
msgid ""
"The old monk sweeps upstairs. We let him. A clan that hides under a temple is never found."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3188
msgid ""
"You killed my father. He would say that was the point of him. The clan follows strength, and you are strong. Kneel, Initiates, and rise in the shadows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3196
msgid ""
"Strong, yes. Ready, no. Come back when the Dark Queen's walls are rising, and I will teach you what my father knew."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3199
msgid "My father's killers. Sit, if you like. Nobody here will try it twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3205
msgid "Civilized ones"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3207
msgid ""
"Another druid who listens to trees. Stand in my shade a while. There. Arch Druid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3212
msgid ""
"The wind says Thickbark has grown a new ring. He is unbearable about it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3216
msgid ""
"My cousin Thickbark says you are civilized. He is a poor judge of most things, but not of that. Druids, stand in my shade. A tree's patience is the last lesson, and you have just learned it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3224
msgid ""
"Civilized ones! Thickbark wrote, which for a tree means a century of rustling. If a druid among you ever wants the last lesson, come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3227
msgid "A tree does not talk to strangers who might be carrying axes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:41 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3230
msgid "Tam"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3232
msgid "Tam eats like an orc now. I'm not complaining. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3236
msgid ""
"Tam! He walked in the door an hour ago and asked what's for supper, as if nothing happened. Here. It's what I put by for his wedding, and he can earn another."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3246
msgid "The caves are in the north-east hills. Follow the drums."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3249
msgid ""
"The orcs took my boy Tam to their caves in the hills, north-east of town. You can hear their drums at night. I'm a farmer. I can't fight orcs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3253
msgid "Drums"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3254
msgid ""
"The drums have stopped. Nights are quiet again, and the cows have started giving milk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3260
msgid "Slimes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3261
msgid ""
"Slime eats iron. I sell a lot of swords in this town, and most of them come back as soup."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3264
msgid "Dudley"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3265
msgid ""
"Dudley? He's been drinking since the plague started. Before that he drank because it hadn't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3268
msgid "Joe's account"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3269
msgid ""
"Joe the Exterminator banks with us. Every month the town pays him, and every month he deposits it. I say nothing. I'm a banker."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3272 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3940
msgid "The name"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3273
msgid ""
"The founders named it for the slime they cleared from the spring. Then the slime came back. We kept the name; it saves on signs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3277
msgid ""
"Tenth level is as far as I go. After that you want Rivercity, and a thicker skin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:452 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:422
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:424 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:658 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:667
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:676 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:688 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:694
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:584 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:830 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:839
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:848
msgid "Rivercity"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3281
msgid ""
"Rivercity is west along the river road. Bigger town, bigger thieves. The coach goes Monday, Wednesday and Friday."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:6 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3296
msgid "Gunther"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3285
msgid ""
"Gunther paid Joe a fortune. He says it was a bargain. He also says the slimes are smaller this year."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3288
msgid "Money tree"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3289
msgid ""
"Some fool said money's now growing on trees. Ha! I've watched that tree for a month. Leaves. Leaves and a pigeon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3293
msgid ""
"This place is deserted. You should go to Rivercity--Now there's a town full of action!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3297
msgid ""
"That Gunther, what a dunce! He paid that con man Joe a fortune to clean up this town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3300
msgid "Dues"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3301
msgid ""
"I'll put anyone on the guild roll for free. Dues will cost 25 gold, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3305
msgid ""
"The world is flat and it ends. East of the orchard road the meadow stops and the stars begin. I put that on every map, and people still walk off it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3309
msgid ""
"The orcs have three lookout posts on the hill road. They watch the sheep, then they take the sheep. Burn the posts and they'll have to watch something else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3312
msgid "Toads"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3313
msgid ""
"Some of the toads were people. You can tell by the way they look at you. Don't step on any."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3316
msgid "The plague"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3317
msgid ""
"The plague is a judgement. The slimes are its messengers. Joe is... also involved."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3320
msgid "Slime lords"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3321
msgid "Slime lords shall rule. Probably. We are waiting for a sign."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3324
msgid "Prices"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3325
msgid ""
"Paid up front, because in Rivercity the customer is gone by morning, and so is the sword."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3328
msgid "Robbers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3329
msgid ""
"The robbers under the bridge have never robbed this bank. We pay them not to. It's called insurance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3333
msgid ""
"Water's two coppers since the fountain dried up. I didn't plug it. I just noticed it was plugged."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3337
msgid ""
"Twenty-fifth level, no further. After that you want the King's own hall at Castle Burlock, and a title to get in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3341
msgid ""
"Pray, pay, and be healed today. Pray without paying and we'll see about tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3344
msgid "Coaches"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3345
msgid ""
"East to Vertigo on the river road. North to the King when the savannah road's clear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3348
msgid "Gossip"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3349
msgid ""
"The robbers live under the bridge. The sorceresses live by the south quay. The King lives in a castle and never comes here. Everybody knows everything in Rivercity, and nobody does anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3352
msgid "The den"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3353
msgid ""
"The den's under the bridge, behind the third pier. There's a door you can't see until you look at it properly. I never told you that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3356
msgid "Stars"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3357
msgid ""
"For 2,000 gold I will teach you how to use the stars to keep from getting lost. Nobody pays. Nobody ever gets lost either. I don't understand it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3360 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3420 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3836
msgid "The King"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3361
msgid ""
"King Burlock holds court at his castle north of here. Only Crusaders pass the inner gate. Earn the title and he may see you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3364
msgid "Darzog"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3365
msgid ""
"Baron Darzog was the King's master sorcerer. His tower on the lake isle has been shut for years. Some say a skeleton key opens it; nobody says where the key is."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3368
msgid "Climbing"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3369
msgid ""
"For the low, low, price of 5,000 gold, I will teach you how to climb the highest mountains. Mountains in your way? Try due north."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3372
msgid "The lake"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3373
msgid ""
"Medin says beasts eat the fish. I've seen them. They eat the boats too, when the boats are near enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3376
msgid "Bodybuilding"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3377
msgid ""
"I see that you are pale and weak. Bodybuilding will put some meat on your bones. I teach it; the meat is extra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3380
msgid "Fighting"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3381
msgid ""
"Fighting is simple. Hit them before they hit you. The rest is details, and I teach the details."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3384 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3556
msgid "Work"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3385
msgid ""
"I'll give you 100 gold for a week of work. Not today, though. Today all the work went to the robbers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3388
msgid "Mirrors"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3389
msgid ""
"Touch the mirror on the square, and any other mirror you've touched will send you there. Faster than my ferry. Everything is faster than my ferry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3392
msgid "Swimming"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3393
msgid ""
"I can teach you how to swim for a mere 100 gold. Or sell you a Water Walk scroll, if you sink."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3396 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3692
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3397
msgid ""
"Death and taxes. Out here in the lagoon it's mostly death. That's why the land is cheap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3400
msgid "The sorceress"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3401
msgid ""
"The sorceress who did this lives in Rivercity now, by the south quay, with her sisters. Barok the Sorcerer knows them. Everyone who has lost something to them knows them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3405
msgid ""
"My brother Falagar thinks every theft is a plot. This time he might be right, which he'll never let me forget."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3408
msgid "Carlawna"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3409
msgid ""
"My sister's a cleric and I'm a wizard. At dinner we argue whether the soup is a miracle or a reaction."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3412
msgid "The curse"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3413
msgid ""
"The guild never closed. We met in the cellar and took the minutesss with our tailsss. Nobody could read them after."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3416
msgid "The Prince"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3417
msgid ""
"My brother is home after years abroad. He hardly eats and never sleeps. Travel does that, I'm told. Now: the mirror."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3421
msgid ""
"The King hears little these days but the word 'mirror'. I say 'mirror' first, then what I came to say. It works about half the time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3426
msgid ""
"The cellar door, behind the kitchens. Lock it behind you if you come back up. Or don't come back up. Either way, lock it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3429
msgid ""
"A word the King doesn't want to hear: the trolls broke out of their cells below the castle, and nobody has gone down since. The King will not hear of it, so I'm telling you. Here is the dungeon key. Bring the castle its cellar back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3436
msgid "Castles"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3437
msgid ""
"A wall, then a keep, then a dungeon. Then the people in the dungeon want out. That's not my department."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3440
msgid "The court"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3441
msgid ""
"Father hunts the mirror, my uncle hunts nothing at all, and I read. Somebody in this family has to know things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3445
msgid ""
"Only one sword can slay Lord Xeen. It lies in the ruins of the dungeon under Newcastle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3448 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:262 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:50
msgid "The Sphinx"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3449
msgid "The name of the Sphinx is Golux."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3452
msgid "The key"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3453
msgid "The key to the Tower of High Magic lies in the Cave of Illusion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3456
msgid "The password"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3457
msgid ""
"I hear the secret password for Newcastle dungeon is 'laboratory'. Not much of a secret if you ask me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3461
msgid "Lord Xeen already has the Sixth Mirror."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3466
msgid ""
"I see an old man in a tower on an island, and a baron who copies himself. Free the one; the others are all the same man."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3470
msgid ""
"I see a sword under a castle you own, and a door that wants a word. You already know the word. You just don't know you know it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3474
msgid ""
"I see a queen who will not look at your neck, and a griffin who will not wear plain leather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3478
msgid ""
"I see a pyramid in a desert, and a reptile in it who wants his marble back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3482
msgid ""
"I see something that fell from the stars into lava, and is still waiting for someone to finish its sentence."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3486
msgid ""
"I see the Pharaoh again. He has a title for you. He's had it ready for some time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3489
msgid ""
"I see a city in the clouds, and a box with nobody in it yet. After that it gets crowded. I'll stop there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3492
msgid "The guidebook"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3493
msgid ""
"Eeried's guidebook calls the Darkside cosy. He wrote it before the siege. And, I think, before the sun went small."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3497
msgid ""
"The Gremlin King has more bark than bite. He'll send his guards against you, but he's too cowardly to fight you personally. If you defeat his guards, he will probably do anything you want."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3501
msgid ""
"Don't trust Joe. He has some sort of scheme to sell fake treasure maps to fools willing to believe his lies about buried treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3505
msgid ""
"Monsters can't count. Monsters can't spel, either. That's why the vault is safe."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3508
msgid "The siege"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3509
msgid ""
"They camp outside and wait. We sit inside and wait. Whoever gets bored first loses. We have the tavern."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3513
msgid ""
"You will have a hard time finding spells if you don't look for them in the guild. That's a hint."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3516
msgid "The pond"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3517
msgid ""
"The acid pond outside the walls is not water. Don't drink it, don't swim in it, and don't believe the frogs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3520
msgid "The mines"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3521
msgid ""
"The Gemstone Mines run under the hills. Rubies, emeralds, and things with teeth that like rubies too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3524
msgid "The roster"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3525
msgid ""
"Folk sign on here to wait for a party worth joining. Some have waited years. Some are worth it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3528
msgid "The bench"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3529
msgid ""
"'This bench reserved for Lyle the Pigeon Feeder.' That's me. I had the sign made. I've sat on it twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3532
msgid "Dark elves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3533
msgid "My people talk to no one. I talked to someone. Hence, Castleview."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3536
msgid "The Dark Grove"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3537
msgid ""
"The tallest tree in the Dark Grove has a rope hanging down from the sky. Nobody who climbed it has come back down to say what's up there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3540
msgid "The monks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3541
msgid ""
"Don't listen to the Drawkcab Monks. Little of what they say makes sense, and what little makes sense is just plain wrong! They've got it all backwards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3545
msgid ""
"Every city requires a pass to enter since Alamar took over. Someone is selling passes to Castleview just outside the gate, for cheap. Be sure to get one before you try to get back inside the town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3548
msgid "The mill"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3549
msgid ""
"The gremlins burned my mill and left a note. It said 'Ha'. Spelled wrong."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3552
msgid "Soup"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3553
msgid ""
"Melon soup again. The melon farmer sends what the monkeydog doesn't eat."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3557
msgid ""
"Wanna job? Fifty gold a week, no experience necessary. You'd be fixing what the gremlins break. Forever."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3560
msgid "The monkeydog"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3561
msgid ""
"There's a monkeydog in the sprite forest who'll do anything for a Monga melon. Anything. Mind your melons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3564
msgid "Towers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3565
msgid ""
"Each tower requires a key for entry... but sometimes they leave the door on top of the towers unlocked. You may be able to get into some towers from the skyroads above Darkside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3568 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3652
msgid "Treasure"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3569
msgid ""
"Don't waste your time chasing treasure that runs from you. You can't catch it. My husband tried."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3573
msgid ""
"It is the beginning of the end. These are the final days! Ruin is upon us! We are doomed, DOOMED I tell you! Also, supper is at six."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3576 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3620 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3868
msgid "The sun"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3577
msgid ""
"The sun gets smaller every year and my lamps get bigger. One of us is going to win."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:281 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3580
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:151
msgid "Ellinger"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3581
msgid ""
"Ellinger has a great fondness for boots. Why, I couldn't say. I make saddles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3584 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3708 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3780
msgid "The sewer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3585
msgid ""
"The sewer drains into my moat, and the rats come with it. Big ones. One of them was wearing a necklace."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3589
msgid ""
"The Gremlins sure have ruined this city. Mayor Snarfblad is too nice. He should have executed those little creeps long ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3593
msgid ""
"Perhaps Alamar will just go away if we close our eyes and wish real hard!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3596
msgid "Forbidden fruit"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3597
msgid ""
"The hut in the clearing has a basket labelled Forbidden Fruit. It's labelled for a reason. Mostly the coconut."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3600
msgid "The orcs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3601
msgid ""
"The orcs took the Temple of Bark. They don't even like trees. They just like temples."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3604
msgid "Holes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3605
msgid ""
"Mind the holes in the forest floor. Trolls live down them. They come up for sprites and go back down hungry. We're quick."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3608 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:597 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:618
msgid "The pass"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3609
msgid "The ogres in the pass charge a toll. In teeth. Mostly yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3612
msgid "Genies"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3613
msgid "Never take all of a genie's money. It's greedy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3616 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3676 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:477
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:479
msgid "Vulture Repellant"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3617
msgid "Special today! Vulture Repellant, only 25,000 gold!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3621
msgid ""
"The sun is smaller than last year. The priests say pray harder. I say buy a lamp. I am also a priest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3625
msgid "The wizards drink here. They tip in threats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3628
msgid "Members' room"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3629
msgid ""
"The members' room is under the street, with the brews. The stalkers got in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3632
msgid "The quarter"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3633
msgid ""
"Two wizards from out of town took the quarter's guilds. Astra used to run them all. She lives in town now, plotting politely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3636
msgid "Mastery"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3637
msgid ""
"Master the Spirit? Not from me. An elf priest on Cloudside, Tito, teaches it, once he has his holy book back. He lost it to trolls. Priests do that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3640 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:693
msgid "Lakeside"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3641
msgid ""
"The coven at Lakeside turns away caravans. Sometimes it turns them into other things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3644
msgid "Your palm"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3645
msgid ""
"I predict you will go on a long journey. I also predict that you will become very rich and famous. I further predict that you will die young...and then be resurrected...and then die again...over and over."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3648
msgid "Thieves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3649
msgid ""
"The thieves in the Southern Tower keep a ledger. Thieves who write things down. Amateurs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3653
msgid ""
"I hear there is a huge hoard of treasure buried somewhere in the land, but the map to it was lost years ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3656
msgid "Names"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3657
msgid ""
"I sense Alamar is an assumed name. I study names, I would know. What the real one is, I can't tell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3661
msgid ""
"No matter how skilled a wizard is, he'll go down before a good sword and a steady hand. Face them down! If you run from them, they'll just shoot you in the back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3664
msgid "Spices"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3665
msgid ""
"Pepper from Castleview, salt from the Desert of Doom. The salt is mostly sand. So is the pepper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3669 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:483
msgid ""
"The wizards in this town are sensitive to insults. Watch what you say!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3672
msgid "Firewood"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3673
msgid ""
"Never try to burn green wood. It just doesn't catch fire as easily. Glass needs a hot fire; I learned the slow way."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3677
msgid "Vulture Repellant doesn't work."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3680
msgid "Natasha"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3681
msgid ""
"Natasha will sometimes enchant ordinary things with spells of calm and friendship. The enchantment is useful for taming horses and wild beasts. Her prices are high, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3684
msgid "Decrees"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3685
msgid ""
"Decree forty: no laughing at wizards. Decree forty-one: no laughing near wizards. I'm writing decree two hundred."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3688
msgid "Pots"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3689
msgid ""
"Bury gold in a pot and the wizards dig it up. Bury it in a pot of snakes and they don't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3693
msgid ""
"The wizards tax sand. We have a great deal of sand. You can see the problem."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3696
msgid "The paladin"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3697
msgid ""
"A dying paladin gave all his magical armor to the enchanted boulders of the land for safekeeping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3700 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3936
msgid "Barbarians"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3701
msgid ""
"The Barbarians are friends of the Giants. Insult the one and you anger the other."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3704 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4024
msgid "The forest"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3705
msgid ""
"Don't sleep in the Aging Forest. My uncle went in for a nap and came out my grandfather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3709
msgid ""
"There is a passage in the sewer that leads a long ways under the desert."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3712
msgid "Roads"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3713
msgid ""
"Six roads meet here. One goes to Castleview, one to Sandcaster, and the other four go somewhere expensive."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3717
msgid ""
"Boots won't stop the hornets in the Aging Forest. Nothing stops those hornets. Run."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3720
msgid "Secret doors"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3721
msgid ""
"Spotting secret doors is an art that has taken many years to master, but I could teach you in a matter of minutes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3725
msgid ""
"The coven meets under the town. I kept their books. I never read them. Well, I read the totals."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3728
msgid "The tavern"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3729
msgid ""
"The witches said the tavern was destroyed long ago. It was under a dust sheet and a spell. We found the ale still cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3732 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3752
msgid "The Isle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3733
msgid ""
"The Isle of Lost Souls takes in what the coven threw away. There's a dungeon under it, and something in there singing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3736
msgid "Octopods"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3737
msgid ""
"Octopods in the deep water. They don't bite. They hug. Then they take you down for a better look."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3740
msgid "Blackfang"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3741
msgid ""
"Castle Blackfang sits on its crag in a storm of bats. You can't walk in. Nobody walks in. Some fly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3745
msgid ""
"Being a goblin was great. You can eat anything. Mum says I have to stop eating anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3748
msgid "Magic Mountain"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3749
msgid ""
"Two wizards camp on Magic Mountain. They argue about fountains all day. You can hear them from the reeds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3753
msgid ""
"If you go to the Isle of Lost Souls, look for a girl with my eyes. Or a goblin with them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3756
msgid "The sign"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3757
msgid ""
"\"This boat under repair.\" Best sign I ever painted. Kept the witches off it for two years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3760 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4060
msgid "The well"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3761
msgid ""
"Don't drink from the black well in the square. It brings death quickly. We use it for the tea."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3765
msgid ""
"The Books of the Dead are in the city. Read one and gain a lifetime. Read the wrong one and spend it all at once."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3768
msgid "The barrel"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3769
msgid ""
"\"Food for the dead, keep warm.\" I wrote it on the barrel. Nobody eats it. It's tradition."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3773
msgid ""
"Young vampires think it's all capes and castles. It's mostly avoiding windows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3776
msgid "Traps"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3777
msgid ""
"The best trap is the one you built yourself and forgot about. I should know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3781
msgid ""
"Something under the city keeps its heart in a box. I don't dig near the sewer. Even I have limits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3784
msgid "Two necromancers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3785
msgid ""
"Two necromancers once argued over who was more dead. The cemetery still hasn't recovered. Ask the skull; it tells it better."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3788
msgid "Nectar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3789
msgid ""
"Fill your packs with the nectar of the Gods while you are here. Those supplies will last much longer than the earthly ones you are used to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3792
msgid "Labours"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3793
msgid "Twelve labours, and the hardest was the paperwork."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3796
msgid "Ants"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3797
msgid ""
"The people are so small they look like ants, and the mountains and trees look like children's toys. I'm the only thing up here worth looking at."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3800
msgid "Nine"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3801
msgid ""
"Alamar's birth number is nine, so he naturally prefers to use that number, for any particular purpose, above all others."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3804
msgid "Ligono"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3805
msgid ""
"Ligono is a ghost who hated the surf. Someone set him free, I'm told. He's always late."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3808
msgid "Empath"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3809
msgid ""
"As an empath, I am quite perceptive to my surroundings. Since you are on a quest to save the world, I'll teach you to be more aware of immediate danger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3813
msgid ""
"I am the castle Armsmaster. I will teach you to use your weapons more accurately in combat, if you like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3816
msgid "Astrology"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3817
msgid ""
"The stars tell you what a thing is, if you know how to ask. Swords are easy. Rings lie."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3820
msgid "Out of phase"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3821
msgid ""
"Thanks for bringing the castle back to reality. We've been trapped here ever since Alamar moved the Castle out of phase. We were starting to run out of food!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3825
msgid ""
"Surely you must know what Alamar has done! No? Why, he slew the guards and stole the Cube of Power, that's what!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3828
msgid "Lizard innards"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3829
msgid ""
"If it weren't for our large stockpile of sun dried lizard innards we surely would have starved to death. The horses ate them too. They were not pleased."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3833
msgid ""
"Alamar walked past twelve of my guards on his way out. They did not get up. I teach the shield so that it never happens again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3837
msgid ""
"The King has me taste his ale first. I've never been healthier. Or happier."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3840 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3864
msgid "The tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3841
msgid ""
"The Northern Tower's knights write without vowels. Hard to argue with someone who can't spell argue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3844
msgid "The pyramid"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3845
msgid ""
"There's a broken travel pyramid out in the desert. I took a look. It's not broken. It's switched off. Big difference."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3848
msgid "The ruins"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3849
msgid ""
"The ruins on the rise were a castle once. Ebenezer sells them now. He sells anything that holds still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3852
msgid "The crypt"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3853
msgid ""
"The crypt under Nightshadow was full when the Count came. It is fuller now. We pray over it from a distance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3856
msgid "The tomb"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3857
msgid ""
"The Tomb of a Thousand Terrors is out in the marsh. Somebody counted. There are a thousand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3860
msgid "Under the floor"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3861
msgid ""
"Nine years under the floorboards. We counted the Count's footsteps. He paced a lot, for a dead man."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3865
msgid ""
"The wizards in the Tower of High Magic never came down to help us. Too high, they said. Too magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3869
msgid ""
"Mother says the sun is a big lamp. Merrin the lamplighter says it's bigger than that. Is it bigger than that?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3872
msgid "Collars"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3873
msgid ""
"High collars are out of fashion now. I have four hundred left. Want one? Want ten?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3876
msgid "Graves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3877
msgid ""
"The Count's guests didn't stay buried. I'm paid by the burial, so I'm not complaining."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3880
msgid "The ballad"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3881
msgid ""
"The Ballad of the Count. Verse one: he bit. Verse two: he bit again. It goes on like that for a while."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3884
msgid "The lagoon"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3885
msgid ""
"There's a woman on a rock in the lagoon, complaining about her legs. I wrote it down. Somebody should go and ask her why."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3888
msgid "The taxman"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3889
msgid ""
"Ebenezer taxed my lean-to. I told him the roof was a gift from the rain. He taxed the rain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3892
msgid "The dials"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3893
msgid ""
"The dials are set to the right hour now. Which one? All of them. That's the trick of a sundial."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3896
msgid "Locks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3897
msgid "The Count's coffin had no lock. He didn't need one. Nobody wanted in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3900 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3944 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:611
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:613 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:827 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:863
msgid "Asp"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3901
msgid ""
"Asp sends us its sick. Lately they come in hissing. Sister Mabel at the roadside shrine sees most of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3904
msgid "The lists"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3905
msgid ""
"The jousting lists are open to anyone with a horse and no sense. Knock a knight off and the crowd cheers. Get knocked off and they cheer louder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3908
msgid "Gargoyles"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3909
msgid ""
"The gargoyles up in the range steal anything shiny. Last week they took a bucket. It wasn't even shiny."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:151 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3912
msgid "Old Wat"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3913
msgid "Old Wat says he never fell off, he was pushed. I was there. I pushed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3917
msgid ""
"The King wants the Sixth Mirror. Last seen near the great volcano, he says. Near is a big word next to a volcano."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3920
msgid "The escapee"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3921
msgid ""
"My finest specimen escaped last spring. A sloth. We are still looking for it, slowly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3925
msgid ""
"Hear ye! The King still seeks the Sixth Mirror. Hear ye! Still. That is the news."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3928
msgid "The fountain"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3929
msgid ""
"Drink from the Olympian Fountain out past the lists. It made me strong enough to fall off a horse for forty years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3933
msgid ""
"The red dwarves used to come for bread through their old west tunnel. Since the mad clan, nobody comes. Somebody should open it again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3937
msgid ""
"Barbarians camp out on the savannah. Burn their tents and they move. Not far. But they move."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3941
msgid ""
"Joe. No relation to the exterminator in Vertigo. People ask. People always ask."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3946
msgid ""
"Asp's open again. The townsfolk walk on legs now. Most of them don't hiss. Most."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3949
msgid ""
"Don't go into town. Things in there hiss back. The pit is out here for a reason."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3952 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3964
msgid "The pedestals"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3953
msgid ""
"Folk say the stones round Asp's well do something if you touch them in the right order. Folk also say I should mind my own business."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3956
msgid "The tail"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3957
msgid "Want to see where the tail was? No? Most people don't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3960
msgid "The machine"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3961
msgid ""
"There was a machine under the town making snakes of us. Who builds a thing like that? Who pays for it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3965
msgid ""
"Start in the corner, red first, then round the well. The children play it as a game now. The machine never liked games."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3969
msgid "Mouse pie, mouse stew, mouse on a stick. I've retired the cookbook."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3973
msgid ""
"The day the curse ended I made a hundred pairs of boots. Sold them all by noon. Snakes don't buy boots."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3976
msgid "Your fortune"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3977
msgid ""
"You will travel far, fight much and complain about the coaches. That's two copper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3980
msgid "The huts"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3981
msgid ""
"A wizard and his sister live in huts out on the savannah. He came asking about crystals from Asp. I sell flour."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3984
msgid "The rolls"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3985
msgid ""
"The guild is closed to all newcomers, so I can't enter your name on the rolls. If I receive a gift of 1000 gold, however, I may fall asleep with the roll book open. (wink, wink)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3990
msgid ""
"The ghosts are gone. It's very quiet. I liked it better when I could blame the noise on them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3993
msgid ""
"The ghosts don't bother the guild. We think about them very hard and they leave. The mayor tried it. It didn't work for him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3996
msgid "The gongs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3997
msgid ""
"The gongs still hang in the square. We polish them. We don't ring them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4000
msgid "Ghostslayers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4001
msgid ""
"Ghostslayers Extraordinaire. The mayor had the plaque engraved before you'd finished. He's an optimist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4005
msgid ""
"The trolls in the forest gnaw on the trees. The trees complain. Yes, the trees."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4008
msgid "The Acme"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4009
msgid ""
"The Acme Ghost Visualization System. Point it at a ghost, see a ghost. Point it at anything else, see a ghost. Excellent value."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4012
msgid "Giants"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4013
msgid ""
"Cyclopes live in the south-west, past the frozen lakes. One eye each, and they still saw me first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4016 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4040 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:621
msgid "The pagoda"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4017
msgid ""
"Kai Wu's old pagoda is full of ninja now. You won't see them. That's the point of ninja."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4020
msgid "The skull"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4021
msgid ""
"There's a cave in the hills where a skull talks. It sells things, for gems. I paid it three for a fish. It lied."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4025
msgid ""
"Something stomps about in the snowy forest at night. Too heavy for a troll. The goats won't go near that hill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4028
msgid "Trees"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4029
msgid ""
"Don't cut the trees at the forest's edge. Some of them talk. One asked me to stop. Politely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4033
msgid ""
"The ghosts said the gongs hurt their ears. I think they were just lonely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4036
msgid "The ledger"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4037
msgid ""
"Four hundred names in the old ledger. Forty in the new. Some days the old one feels more crowded."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4041
msgid ""
"Our brothers in the pagoda chose the dark path. Kai Wu still sets their places at dinner."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4044
msgid "The black tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4045
msgid ""
"The black tower on the rim? Sealed. Old as the world. His Majesty says not to knock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4048
msgid "Mountains"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4049
msgid ""
"My name you have heard, and you come to me to learn how to climb mountains. Climbing is mostly not falling. The rest is legs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4052
msgid "Prayer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4053
msgid ""
"Everyone should learn how to pray properly. I can teach anyone for free! The first thing you will have to do is put 10,000 gold in that urn over there..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4057
msgid ""
"There were wood golems in the foundations when we came. We kept one as a hat stand. It keeps the hats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4061
msgid ""
"The diggers call the courtyard well your well. Drink and you'll feel well armoured. It's a pun. I didn't make it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4065
msgid ""
"King's Megacredits pay the King's engineers. Gold pays everyone else. I keep both columns."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4068
msgid "Toast"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4069
msgid "Try peanut butter and honey on your morning toast."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4072
msgid "Everything"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4073
msgid ""
"I will teach you everything for 100,000 gold. Or learning for less, and you can work out the rest yourselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4076
msgid "The crystal"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4077
msgid ""
"Smile. The intent expression you are wearing is being broadcast to millions from the hidden crystal in the wall. Wave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4081
msgid ""
"Once you have purchased a dungeon you have no need for Megacredits. Not that I would know. I inherited mine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4084
msgid "Tips"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4085
msgid ""
"The tavern in Shangri-La has the best tips. Wilbur's tip: honey. Kublai's tip: leave quietly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4088
msgid "Aging"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4089
msgid ""
"If you have suffered magical aging, the druids can help you. Visit the Druid of Summer first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4092
msgid "The moons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4093
msgid ""
"The moons will align when you are able to visit the Darkside. Then again, you probably already have."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4098
msgid ""
"The Art of Bodybuilding, by Barticus. Chapter One: Lift. Chapter Two: Lift Again. The other forty chapters say the same, with pictures."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4104
msgid "One per member. Barticus counts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4113
msgid "You draw the bolt. The grate swings open on a long tunnel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4132
msgid "Enjoy the facilities."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4138
msgid "Protein Brew. It is thick enough to chew. +2 Might (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4151
msgid ""
"Vitamin Brew. It tastes of chalk and good intentions. +2 Endurance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4173
msgid ""
"Inside the bottle you find a message that reads: Help! I'm in Darzog's tower!--Crodo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4183
msgid ""
"Vertigo. For weeks you dreamt of an old man in a dark tower who begged you to finish \"the sword\". Then a bolt from the sky destroyed Newcastle, and you woke here among its survivors. Mayor Gunther asks your help: slimes and doom bugs plague the town. The town hall is on the main street."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4196
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Solve the wood, it's like a tree / Cut the branches and return to me / Next is stone, it's full of blocks / Push them around, expose six rocks / Last is iron, there is a key / Set the tumblers and you'll be free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4209
msgid ""
"Written on a plaque: All is set, it is plain to see / Master of Golems I now dub thee. King's Megacredit!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4227
msgid ""
"King's Megacredit! Five of them, in a coffin that was never meant for anyone dead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4233
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Welcome to the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors. Insanity is our fame, undead is our game."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4239
msgid ""
"The Temple of Yak. Mirabeth's Elixir of Restoration is kept somewhere inside, and the King's Megacredits too, they say. Incense, old stone, and something underneath that the incense is there to hide."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4256
msgid "King's Megacredits!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4271
msgid ""
"\"For ten gems I'll give you a key,\" the skull says. It takes ten of your gems. The skull gives you the key to the tower of High Magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4277
msgid ""
"\"Five gems for three points,\" the skull says. \"Down here prices are honest. Up there they're cheap.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4283
msgid ""
"\"Ten gems,\" the great skull says, \"and five points of Might, Endurance or Accuracy. Choose. I don't do refunds.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4289
msgid ""
"The skull looks at your purse and says nothing at all, which is worse."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4295
msgid "\"You've had yours,\" the skull says. \"Next.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4301
msgid ""
"\"Three gems,\" the skull says, \"and I'll make you two better than you are. Once. I'm not a charity.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4320
msgid ""
"You found a skeleton key in the chest. Its bow is a grinning skull, and its teeth fit no lock in this tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4335
msgid ""
"You step out of the pyramid under an amber sky. The sun is small and pale, and the light is the colour of old brass. Ahead, Castleview's walls are ringed with siege works, and something small has sawn through the bridge's ropes. This is the land below the land."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4348
msgid ""
"The guard reads your pass twice, holds it up to the light, and lets you in. \"Mind the gremlins. If it's small and grinning, it isn't a child.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4360
msgid ""
"The guard unbars the gate and waves you out. 'Out is free. In takes a pass.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4370
msgid ""
"In the rats' nest, among bottle caps and buttons: an onyx necklace on a silver chain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4383
msgid ""
"Boots of Paradise, by Ellinger J. Hofenhager. \"Ah, lovely boots! Sweet leather foot holders, hard iron hobnail, how I adore thee!\" The rest goes on like that for two hundred pages."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4392
msgid "You may pass!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4398
msgid "Begone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4404
msgid ""
"\"Intruders, answer the following question or be destroyed!\" A barbarous villain has been robbing and killing travellers in the mountains for months. Your liege charges you to stop him. You strike his sword from his hand. Do you chivalrously let him retrieve it, knowing he may yet win and go on with his crimes, or do you slay him unarmed and honor your oath to your liege? 1) I allow him to retrieve his weapon. 2) I cut him down where he stands. 3) Um, I... I just don't know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4412
msgid "\"An answer. Not the one I'd give, but an answer.\" The door opens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4418
msgid "\"Begone!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4431
msgid "Reading the book improves your mind. +2 Intellect (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4437
msgid "You read the book, but learn nothing new."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4443
msgid ""
"As you read the book, the pages begin to swim before your eyes and your head begins to ache. The ache builds to pain, the pain to agony. Understanding belatedly that you shouldn't be reading the book, you put it back on the shelf, but not quickly enough to avoid getting hurt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4464
msgid ""
"A list in Ellinger's hand: \"Discs. Gremlins (3, if they can be made to talk). Sprites. Ogres. The towers, two each. The Temple of Bark. The castle itself, once it is back. The giants, if anyone is that brave.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4470
msgid ""
"Castle Kalindra. Half of it is solid stone; the rest still shimmers behind walls of light. The throne is empty, and dust lies on it like snow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4485
msgid ""
"Behind the safe's door, wrapped in velvet like jewels: two energy discs. Someone in this castle knew what they were worth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4498
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4501
msgid "Please help clean up our beautiful town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4512
msgid ""
"Inside the crate you find a piece of paper that reads: \"Breeder Slimes, 1 mated pair, 287. 5 Doom Bugs at 145 each, 725. Total: 1012 gold.\" It appears that Joe has been buying monsters and distributing them around town! Mayor Gunther will want to hear about this."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4519
msgid "A sign hanging on the side of the desk reads: 'Out of Business'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4529
msgid "Under the rain barrel, wrapped in oilcloth: a key."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4548
msgid ""
"Darzog's Tower. The Skeleton Key turns, and the door that has been sealed since Crodo vanished swings in on cold air. Artemus was right about the Baron: somewhere above, Crodo still lives. And the air itself is wrong. Every spell you reach for dies before it is shaped. Here you fight with steel. The stairs climb the west and east halls in turn; the Baron keeps the top floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4560
msgid ""
"Crodo the Overseer, thin and grey, gets up from his stool. \"Thank you for rescuing me from Darzog's clutches. I didn't know that someone else had received my message. Listen. The man at the King's side is not Prince Roland. I struck him with Dancing Blades and saw what he is: Lord Xeen, an undead general who serves a greater master. Xeen's hideout is just above us in the clouds. You will need the sword the adventurers were working on in the dungeon of Newcastle to defeat Lord Xeen. Ask Artemus for leave to dig it out. The vault's word is 'laboratory'. You must make haste. Xeen plans to summon an army from the Darkside to conquer our world.\" Darzog's ward still holds him, but it is fading. He has strength for one small spell, and he spends it on going home. He touches your hand, says a word, and is gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4567
msgid ""
"Baron Darzog falls, and the tower shudders. Somewhere close a binding cracks like ice; in the Well a black grille rises from the landing where his disc waits. His ward on your spells does not lift: it has soaked into the stones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4587
msgid ""
"On a rack of tools nobody remembers how to use: a long blade with no shine at all. The tag on its hilt reads XEEN SLAYER. EXPERIMENTAL. DO NOT DROP."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4593
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 2: bo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4599
msgid "Scratched into the stone, in a hurried hand: 1: la"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4605
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 3: ra"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4611
msgid ""
"Scratched into the stone: 5: ry. Someone did not trust his own memory."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4617
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 4: to"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4626
msgid "The humming stops. The vault door slides into the wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4632
msgid ""
"Carved over the gate: NEVER UNDERESTIMATE THE POWER OF POSITIVE THINKING. Under it, smaller: Answer gladly and the way opens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4643
msgid ""
"Sixty-four, fifty-two, thirty-one. The safe opens on four Energy Disks in a velvet tray."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4649
msgid "\"Will you find what you came for?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4655
msgid "\"Is the glass half full?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4661
msgid "\"Will tomorrow be better than today?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4667
msgid "\"Are your friends glad you came?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4673
msgid "\"Is the Songbird waiting for you?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4679
msgid "The gate swings open, cheerfully."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4685
msgid "The gate sighs, and stays shut. So does your mood."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4695
msgid ""
"A small grey bird hops out of the cage onto your hand and sings. For a moment nobody in the party can remember what they were worried about."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4701
msgid "Bats boil out of the towers and beat you out of the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4707
msgid ""
"Iron, black, and no handle on this side. Castle Blackfang does not take visitors on foot."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4714
msgid ""
"The griffin climbs into the dim sky, circles Lakeside once, and drops you on Castle Blackfang's battlements. Ambrose waves and is gone. He will be back for the Queen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4721
msgid "Somewhere far off, glass hums. Across the Darkside, the mirrors wake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4728
msgid ""
"At nightfall Ambrose's griffin lands in the courtyard. The Queen rides in front, the party behind, and nobody looks down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4736
msgid ""
"Count Blackfang falls, and every coffin lid in the castle slams shut at once. The stair to the dungeon grinds open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4748
msgid ""
"The safe opens on the Queen's crown, black iron set with a single pale stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4761
msgid ""
"Castle Blackfang's battlements. Coffins stand in rows along the wall walk, lids ajar, like beds left unmade. The way down is through the Count."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4776
msgid ""
"Every pad in this hall takes you somewhere. Few of them take you anywhere useful."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4782
msgid ""
"A heavy book titled THE PRIME DIRECTIVE. The first page: \"No guardian shall interfere with the world it guards.\" Someone has underlined it twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4790
msgid ""
"The lock chimes a short, smug tune, and the door to the maze slides open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4796
msgid ""
"A brass plaque: REGISTRY NCC-1701. Below, in a different hand: the lock wants the number, not the letters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4802
msgid ""
"Light all four, and the way is open. Light fewer, and stay where you are."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4810
msgid "The fourth torch catches, and the stair door rumbles open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4816
msgid ""
"The console's screen reads, in plain words: TO RELEASE STASIS, ANSWER THE PHRASE: TO BOLDLY GO WHERE NO MAN HAS GONE BEFORE. Beneath: COMPLETE THE PHRASE: TO BOLDLY GO..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4822
msgid ""
"LOG. Pursuit of renegade guardian SHELTEM. Target crossed into the X.E.E.N. project. Collision imminent. Entering stasis."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4828
msgid ""
"LOG. Second pod landed safely. This pod: lava. Stasis holding. Waiting for a reply to the phrase."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4836
msgid ""
"The lava round the hatch is black and cool. The hatch slides aside with a sigh, as if it had been waiting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4849
msgid ""
"The field flickers out. A tall figure in a guardian's armour sits up. \"Corak. I hunted Sheltem from Terra to here, and he has had centuries to prepare. If I step outside, he will feel me the moment I do. I need somewhere to hide that he cannot see into. The Ancients built such things: Soul Boxes. Find me one.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4855
msgid "The field hums. Nothing else happens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4887
msgid ""
"The rope hangs straight and still in the tree's crown. This time, it seems, it will take you all the way up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4895
msgid ""
"Welcome to Olympus. The clouds hold you up, which takes some getting used to. Somewhere up here is Soul Storage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4911
msgid ""
"Soul Storage. Shelf after shelf, all empty but one. On it, a small box of dull metal that is somehow heavier to look at than to lift. The Soul Box."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4917
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: If Pharaoh's realm should take a fall / The Dragon must put forth a call / Mystic orb to the wind is cast / Seeks the hand of heroes last / Four parts castle at five per stage / A score of disks to help the Mage"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4923
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: A Golden bird will sorrow ease / Sweet song will Knight's lost soul appease / Help the rider to soothe the beast / Gain a flight when expected least / The symbol of royal power / Frees the Queen from evil tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4929
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Dragon's orb the world shall roam / Yet must again return to home / Pharaoh's magic back in its place / Helps to free the visitor from space / Code's the key to thinking machines / Starman knows the truth about Xeen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4935
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Dragon once more will get you by / Owns key to city of the sky / Starman needs to hide in a box / Alamar's defenses outfox / Face to face in Alamar's lair / Out the box springs the land's last prayer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:494 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:540
msgid "Pests"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4943
msgid ""
"All beings have a true name. Alamar's true name, for instance, is Sheltem."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4952
msgid ""
"The Soul Box hums very faintly in your pack. Nothing in the castle seems to notice you. That is the point."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4958
msgid ""
"Castle Alamar. Every window is lit, and every one of them is looking at you. Enter?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:496
msgid ""
"Joe swears he has the situation under control. He has sworn it for two years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4975
msgid ""
"You throw the Soul Box to the ground. Corak steps out of it, taller than the room. \"Sheltem.\" \"Corak. You took your time.\" They close on each other, and the castle begins to shake itself apart. Corak's voice, from inside the light: \"The Cube! Take it and run!\" You run, with the Cube of Power, and behind you Castle Alamar folds into the ground."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4987
msgid ""
"The time is right. The gate asks Alamar's true name. \"Sheltem,\" you say, and the gate says: Access approved!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:499
msgid ""
"Welcome to Vertigo. Sadly, most of the population has left because the town is infested with pests. A couple years ago I hired Joe the exterminator to rid the town of this menace, but the problem seems to be getting worse. Perhaps you could help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4993
msgid "Wrong! Access denied!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5001 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5026 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5061
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5104
msgid ""
"Slick: Get outta my face! You've already won the prize. Go play one of the other games."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5009
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. Shoot the bullseye ten times in a row, and you win! (Ten.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5015
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Shoot the bullseye ten times in a row. (Seven.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5018
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. The arrows are free. The gems are not."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5034
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. If you can stay on the treadmill longer than 2 minutes, you win! (You can.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5040
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Stay on the treadmill longer than 2 minutes. (You can't.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5043
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Gems first, treadmill second."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5053
msgid "Enter Castle Xeen?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:506
msgid "Joe's invoice"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5069
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up and ring the bell with the hammer! (DING.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:507
msgid ""
"Thank you for cleaning up Vertigo and discovering Joe's treachery. Now it makes sense why the extermination of the pests was taking so long. I present you with the outstanding citizenship award and this treasure. Congratulations. Oh, one more thing. I have received a message from the dwarves who reside in the Red Dwarf Range. They have urgently requested help and promise great reward to whoever is brave enough to come. Apparently, their mines have been invaded by the Mad Dwarf Clan, preventing them from mining. Help them and report back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5075
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up and ring the bell with the hammer! (thunk.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5078
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. No gold, no hammer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5096
msgid ""
"Slick: I see that you have four dolls. A genuine Lord Xeen cupie doll, then. Now get lost, and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5112
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. If you are faster than the gremlin you'll win. (You are.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5118
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. If you are faster than the gremlin you'll win. (The gremlin waves from the finish.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5121
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. The gremlin doesn't race for free, and neither do you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5127
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Advisor will a dig permit / five coins more you must submit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5133
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Taxman becomes a faithful vassal / Xeen's bane lies under castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5139
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: In clouds above island tower / waits Lord Xeen his final hour."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5145
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Only the sword Xeen's life can take / All his plans of war unmake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5153
msgid ""
"Castle Xeen. The walls hum with the generators somewhere inside, and the guard machines are already making more guards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5162
msgid ""
"The air generator whines down to silence. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5171
msgid "The earth generator grinds to a stop. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5180
msgid ""
"The fire generator coughs, roars, and goes out. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5189
msgid ""
"The water generator drains with a long gurgle. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5198
msgid ""
"\"You have no idea what you have broken.\" Lord Xeen falls, and the face he wore at court, Prince Roland's, slides off him like wet paper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5207
msgid ""
"Lord Xeen looks up from his throne and laughs. \"The King's little crusaders, all this way up. Kneel, and I may let you fall gently.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5215
msgid "Xeen's Pet lies still. Its cage door was never locked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5231
msgid ""
"You take the Scepter of Temporal Distortion from the throne. Behind it the Sixth Mirror, the one the King wanted so badly, cracks from corner to corner and falls in pieces."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5244
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. Somewhere far to the south, something answers it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5257
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The snow on its housing slides off in one sheet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:526
msgid "Joe's gone. (hic) Good riddance. (hicup) Who's buying?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5270
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The heat of the mountain seems to lean towards it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5283
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The creek beside it runs backwards for a moment, then thinks better of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5289
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing roars like a gale. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:529
msgid ""
"He...he (hic) breeeds (hicup) Breeeeeds them in the (hic) warehouse (hicup)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5295
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing is grey as stone. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5301
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing glows like a forge. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5307
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing heaves like the sea. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5313
msgid "The sky says nothing. The road still ends in nothing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5319
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Two: Awaken the Four Sleepers of Darkside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5325
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Three: Bring together the Cube of Power and the Scepter of Temporal Distortion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:533
msgid "Joe's key"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5331
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step One: When the time is right, activate the machines in the four corners of the other side of the world."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5337
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Four: Travel to the shrine on the Cloud above Darkstone Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:534
msgid ""
"Joe keeps his warehouse key under the rain barrel in his yard. Everybody knows. Nobody looks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5344 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5353
msgid ""
"Air Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5357
msgid ""
"Air Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5360
msgid ""
"Air Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5367 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5376
msgid ""
"Earth Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5380
msgid ""
"Earth Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5383
msgid ""
"Earth Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5390 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5399
msgid ""
"Fire Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5403
msgid ""
"Fire Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5406
msgid ""
"Fire Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:541
msgid ""
"Two years ago, I came to this town on contract to control the vermin infestation. It has been a long, hard job, but I've just about got the situation under control."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5413 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5422
msgid ""
"Water Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5426
msgid ""
"Water Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Awaiting Grunfeld field activation."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5429
msgid ""
"Water Sleeper: The Guardian has not informed me of your status as Chosen Ones. Much as I would like to, I am unable to fully awaken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5435
msgid "You accept the test of Air."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:544
msgid "Warehouse"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5441
msgid "You accept the test of Earth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5447
msgid "You accept the test of Fire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:545
msgid ""
"My warehouse? Strictly off limits. Dangerous chemicals. I don't even carry the key on me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5453
msgid "You accept the test of Water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5462
msgid ""
"In the chest, on a velvet cushion: a key of black stone, cold as the bottom of a well. Darkstone Tower's."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5470
msgid ""
"The stair under the ruin is sealed with Sheltem's mark. The Cube of Power hums, and the mark goes out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5476
msgid "The message on the plaque reads: Nine is the time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5491
msgid ""
"The coffin's lid slides back and a man sits up, blinking. \"Allow me to introduce myself. I am Prince Roland, brother to King Burlock. I must thank you for freeing me from that stasis chamber Alamar put me in. Queen Kalindra and I are destined to marry on the cloud world above Darkstone Tower. You hold the key to the Tower, but you will need a key to open the way to the cloud world above it. That key can be found in the Southern Sphinx on the other side of the world. I have here the Amulet of the Southern Sphinx. Take it. I must return to my brother and prepare for the wedding.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5499
msgid "The skull sees the Cube of Power and says, \"Access granted.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:550
msgid ""
"The dwarves are digging again. You can hear their picks from the town wall, which is more than I asked for."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5505
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach: Not only is Alamar a wise and just ruler, Alamar is sporting, as well. Alamar graciously grants clever opponents a chance to defeat him by leaving hints and clues. But know this: Alamar takes pleasure in the failure of his opponents, especially when they come close to success. And you WILL fail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5513
msgid ""
"The cauldron roars and boils over: green steam boils up the shaft! Get off the bridge!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5520
msgid "The cage hangs open and empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5527
msgid ""
"You touch the Alacorn to his ears: they shrink back, pink and round. He whoops and runs for home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5531
msgid ""
"'I'm not going home with goblin ears!' The boy will not budge. 'They say the witches' Alacorn cures anything. It's up top, over the cauldron.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5535
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. The boy steps out and stops: 'Not with these ears. Mum would die. The witches' Alacorn could cure them. It's up top, over the cauldron.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:554
msgid ""
"The local dwarves have informed me of your great deed and have authorized me to present to you a rare honor: The Red Dwarf Badge of Courage. Congratulations."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5547
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. A girl with a green tinge to her skin tumbles out and hugs you. 'I'm Rosebud. The door at the top of the north stair has a witch's face on it, and it only opens to the coven's key. They keep it in their stores in the herb loft, past the vats. Don't tell them I told you!' Then she is gone, running for Toad Meadow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5558
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. A boy crawls out of the cage, wiping his nose. \"Thanks for getting me out of there,\" he says. \"I thought the witches were going to turn me into a goblin for sure. I want to go home.\" And he runs. Valia will hear of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5569
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. The child in the witches' bedchamber slips out and is gone down the stair. Valia will hear of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5589
msgid "\"Correct, come on up!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5595
msgid "\"Wrong.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5601
msgid "The runes you have read, in the order of the halls: P, I, C, A, R, D."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5609
msgid ""
"The Sphinx's stone eyes find Roland's amulet. Its jaw opens on a stair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5617
msgid ""
"The door at the top of the stair opens on a room full of books, and an old man in a very good chair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5623
msgid "A voice booms: \"No Sound No Ground!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5637
msgid ""
"You strike the Chime of Opening. The note goes on long after it should have stopped, and something you could not see cracks across like ice. The seal has been broken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:564
msgid ""
"The dwarf mines are still being over-run. Please help them. The mine portal is in the hills north-west of town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5645
msgid "The black key turns without a sound. So does the door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5651
msgid "The observatory is closed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5657
msgid ""
"A message reads: It's a long road ahead so rest where you can. But don't forget to recast your spells. Signed, The Dragon Pharaoh"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5675
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh sets the Cube of Power in one hand of the shrine and the Scepter in the other. \"Let the two faces of Xeen be one world again.\" Far off, four sleepers answer at once. The sky turns over, and for a moment you see both faces of Xeen together: a whole world, close to its sun. When you can see again there is a pavilion on the cloud, Prince Roland and Queen Kalindra under it, and the Pharaoh, looking pleased with himself, reading the vows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5696
msgid ""
"You dig where the seven words said. An iron box lies under the sand, left for a Sphinx that never came for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:570
msgid "Falista"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5705
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the first of six words: DIG."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5714
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the second of six words: BENEATH."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:572
msgid ""
"Falista grazes behind my cottage again, Crusaders. She eats the roses. I let her."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5723
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the third of six words: THE."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5732
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fourth of six words: BROKEN."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5741
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fifth of six words: TRAVEL."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5750
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the last of six words: PYRAMID."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:576
msgid ""
"You have destroyed the witches and for that I am grateful. For your gallant deeds, I dub thee all Crusaders! Now I must take the Alacorn, for if I can find Falista, I believe the healing power of the Alacorn is strong enough to resurrect her."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5763
msgid ""
"You dig beneath the broken pyramid's capstone. A chest of old Darkside coin waits there, dry as the day it was buried."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5772
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the first of seven words: SEEK."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5781
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the second of seven words: THE."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5790
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the third of seven words: HOARD."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5799
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fourth of seven words: BURIED."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5808
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fifth of seven words: FOR."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5817
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the sixth of seven words: THE."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5826
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the last of seven words: SPHINX."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5836
msgid ""
"Among the gargoyles' shiny things: a jewelled scarab, and a tag on a string: \"Deliver to Asp: one scarab.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5848
msgid ""
"In the housing, still warm: a cluster of blue crystals that crackle when you touch them. Falagar's, no doubt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5858
msgid "You have found the Elixir of Restoration!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5871 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:505
msgid "Medin rows you across to the island."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5874
msgid ""
"Medin's boat is tied up. \"Not while those beasts circle the island,\" says Medin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:588
msgid ""
"The Alacorn! But the Head Witch still lives, and she will come for it. Finish what you started."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5884
msgid ""
"A rock the size of a fist, still glowing, sits on the cooled flow. It is hot enough to boil snow and somehow not hot enough to burn your gloves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5892
msgid ""
"You burn everything you can, and what you cannot burn you throw outside. The warren fills with smoke, and the trolls that are left will not come back to it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5900
msgid "You destroy the outpost. Glom will be pleased."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5911
msgid ""
"A hollow full of blue speckled sprite eggs, and among them a slim wand of white wood: Danulf's Wand of Faery Magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:592
msgid "I am waiting for you to destroy the witches and return the Alacorn."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5920
msgid ""
"Under a torn pack in the snow: a heavy book bound in green leather, its clasp shaped like a leaf."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5930
msgid ""
"Wedged among the rocks at the world's edge: a skull, still wet with spray. Ligono's, surely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5940
msgid ""
"Under a heap of curse dolls and unpaid bills: a pendant on a silver chain, humming faintly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:595
msgid ""
"I am just an old woman but before I die I wish to see the witches of Toad Meadow destroyed. You see, when I was still a young maiden, I fell asleep in Toad Meadow. When I awoke I found a unicorn laying down beside me. Her name was Falista and she was fleeing from a band of witches who were trying to capture her. Since that day I have kept Falista safely hidden. But now she has disappeared. I fear the worst has happened and the witches have killed her for her Alacorn's magic. Here is the key to their tower. Go quickly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5952
msgid "The statue's stone hands open. In them lies a book: Cure Disease."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5964
msgid "The statue's stone hands open. In them lies a book: Cure Poison."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5973
msgid "Half buried in the creek mud: a whistle carved from bone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5982
msgid "You have found a Phirna plant. Ok, you dug it up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5994
msgid ""
"Celia opens the door with flour on her hands. \"It's you! Derek, look who it is!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:600
msgid "Children"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6006
msgid ""
"The ogres' lair, in the river bluff. Boulders stacked by the cliff edge, and a smell of cooking you would rather not ask about."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6015
msgid "You break everything you can find in the lair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:602
msgid ""
"Every child is home. Their mothers have stopped crying. Their fathers have started."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6024
msgid ""
"You knock the cross-beam out of the rack, and the whole heap of boulders goes thundering over the cliff into the river. That is the end of the ogres' ammunition."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6038
msgid ""
"Two paces north of the cairn, a strongbox. The map was honest. The ink runs in the damp and the map comes apart in your hands, its work done."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6044
msgid "MAPS BY JOE! Genuine! Only one of its kind!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:606
msgid ""
"All four of them home, and not one of them a goblin! Take this. It is not much, but it is all the meadow could gather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6066
msgid ""
"The Art of Taxation, by Scaldrith. \"Chapter One: Everyone pays. Chapter Two: See Chapter One.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6079
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 1: Worms. \"A dragon begins as a worm and ends as a wyrm. The difference is a Y and about nine hundred years.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6092
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 2: Wyverns. \"Two legs, a temper, and no patience for reading. They will not have got this far.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6105
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 3: Drakes. \"A drake is a dragon that has not yet been taxed.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:611
msgid ""
"The witches catch children and turn them into goblins. They keep the ones they haven't turned yet in cages in the tower. Bring them home if you can."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6118
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 4: Wyrms. \"The wyrm sleeps on its hoard for a century and wakes up hungry. Plan accordingly.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6131
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 5: Dragons. \"There is only one. All the others are practice.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6138
msgid "Splinters of horn and a scorch mark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6147
msgid ""
"The demon skull bursts like a coal under a hammer. Somewhere ahead, rock grinds on rock: the way the two skulls kept shut is open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6153
msgid ""
"The demon skull bursts like a coal under a hammer. The cave goes on burning, but something in it has stopped watching you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6160
msgid "Splinters of black bone and a smell of sulphur."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6169
msgid ""
"The devil skull cracks in two and both halves scream. Somewhere ahead, rock grinds on rock: the way the two skulls kept shut is open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:617
msgid "Sixth Mirror"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6175
msgid ""
"The devil skull cracks in two and both halves scream. The cave goes on burning, but something in it has stopped watching you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6183
msgid "Beyond the last cave, cool air, and the smell of grass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6189
msgid ""
"The robbers' den, under the great bridge. Somewhere in here the boss keeps Princess Roxanne's tiara. Dice on the tables, wet boots by the bunks, and the river loud overhead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:619
msgid "The Sixth Mirror. In pieces. It is a pity about the mirror, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6203
msgid "The Robber Boss falls. A ring of heavy keys hangs at his belt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6219
msgid ""
"In a velvet bag under the gang's takings: a diamond tiara, small enough for a princess and heavy enough for a king. Princess Roxanne will want it back at Castle Burlock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6233
msgid ""
"The clan master falls. You have dishonored the Ninjas by entering the Pagoda. They surely will not return to reclaim it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:624
msgid "NO MIRROR?!? Get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6246
msgid ""
"A message appears in the stone: The southwest corner is where to start / Begin with red to tell them apart. Alternate the colors around the well / Then the machine can no longer repel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6252 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:147
msgid "The pedestal is cool to the touch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6268
msgid ""
"The transformer sparks, shudders and dies. Far above, in a cellar in Asp, someone stops hissing in mid-word."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6274
msgid "Acme Ghost Visualization System."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:628
msgid ""
"Ah, more adventurers! I charge you with the quest of finding the Sixth Mirror. My sources tell me that the mirror was last seen near the great volcano. Go forth, now, and bring it to me. I will reward the one who returns it to me with an Earldom."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6280
msgid "We have great treasure you can see. Bang the gong and set us free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6287
msgid "The gong booms over an empty, honest town. Nothing answers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6292
msgid ""
"The note rolls over the empty roofs, and the cold goes out of the air. Mayor Randon will want to hear of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6295
msgid ""
"The note dies in the fog. Somewhere a ghost laughs: \"You'll never win this game of war. The dead shall rule forevermore.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6301
msgid ""
"Bang twice on each northern gong is all you have to do. The well can make you strong, but the order is up to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6307
msgid ""
"1) Destroy all ghosts. 2) Bang southern gong. 3) Re-visit Randon. 4) Repeat as necessary."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6313
msgid "Lives of a cat."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6319
msgid "A stitch in time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6329
msgid ""
"The lid slides aside. There is no Count in the coffin: only a stair, going down, and the smell of old earth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6339
msgid ""
"Count Draco crumbles to dust, and his dust crumbles to less. Up in Nightshadow, shutters open for the first time in years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:634
msgid "Earldom"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6348
msgid ""
"If the dials are properly set, the count will definitely be upset. Open his coffin and bid him farewell; only then can you use the magic of the well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:635
msgid ""
"An Earldom. Land, a title, a seat at my table. Newcastle's ruins are for sale, I hear, if you can't wait. Ebenezer will sell you anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6354
msgid "Only at night can you put up a fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6360
msgid "The Count wakes at nine and sleeps at nine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6367 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:307
msgid ""
"The water is clear and cold, and tastes faintly of garlic. You feel healthier, and somehow more likeable."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6370 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:299
msgid ""
"The water is black and tastes of iron. You decide you are not thirsty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6379
msgid ""
"\"There wolf,\" you say. Something on the other side growls approvingly, and the bolts draw back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6385
msgid "\"Wrong,\" says the door, and something behind it laughs like a dog."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6391
msgid ""
"A thin man rattles his chain. \"Upstairs door? 'There wolf.' I heard them say it a hundred times. And the Sphinx's name is Golux; they argue about it at dinner. Now get me out of here.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6401
msgid ""
"A scroll bound in grey ribbon, labelled INSIGHT in a tidy hand. Someone has been reading it upside down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3460 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3916 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:641
msgid "The mirror"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6412
msgid "The amulet grows warm, and the stone between the paws slides aside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6418
msgid ""
"Hieroglyphs, and under them the message reads: My first is in giant but not in defiant. My second is in mole but not in mule. My third is in lich but not in stitch. My fourth is in guard but not in Girard. My fifth is in XEEN but not in Queen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:642
msgid ""
"My brother has wanted the Sixth Mirror since before I left. Find it, and he may even smile. I have not seen it myself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6431
msgid ""
"\"Golux,\" the Sphinx repeats, pleased. \"Nobody ever asks how I am. Sit where you like.\" The doors to the thrones open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6437
msgid "\"No,\" says the Sphinx, and the floor agrees with it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6443
msgid ""
"The message reads: You're looking for my name, it's five letters long. I think you'll like my name. Try not to get it wrong. A voice booms, \"What is my name?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:645
msgid "Travels"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6450
msgid ""
"You sit on the King's throne. It fits better than it should. (+5 Might)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6457
msgid ""
"The throne of legends. Old names are carved in it; there is room for yours. (+5 Endurance)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:646
msgid ""
"I was away a long time, further than most. The castle seems smaller now. Everything does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6464
msgid ""
"You sit on the Queen's throne, and for a moment everyone in the hall looks at you. (+5 Personality)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6470
msgid ""
"You have sat here before. The throne remembers, and is not impressed twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6477
msgid ""
"The Prince of Thieves' throne. Your hands feel lighter, and somebody's purse feels closer. (+5 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6483
msgid ""
"A burrow under the wall, with a tiny door and a tiny sign: THE COURT. KNOCK LOUDLY. WE WILL IGNORE YOU."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:649
msgid "Crodo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6493
msgid ""
"BY ORDER OF THE MAYOR: the treasury will pay to end the Gremlins' mischief. Their court is the burrow under the wall, east of this gate. Pass holders apply within. Everyone else, apply to the gremlins."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:651
msgid ""
"Crodo is free. Good. The King was pleased for almost a minute, and then asked about the mirror."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6511
msgid ""
"The last guard falls. On the throne, Gettlewaithe has gone a much paler shade of green."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6522
msgid "You find 3 Energy Disks under the late Gettlewaithe's throne."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6528
msgid ""
"Only a scrap of the original text remains legible: ...set the Western dials to 1, Northern to 2, and Eastern to 3. To join the Way of Bark, pull lever and drink of the Crystal Water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6539
msgid ""
"Shaalth's key turns in the cage lock. The princess steps out and straightens her wings."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:655
msgid "You haven't found Crodo yet. Keep searching."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6551
msgid "You are hereby dubbed a Disciple of Bark!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6557
msgid ""
"The poisonous water burns your throat as you take a long drink. Violent tremors wrack your body. They pass, which is more than the water intended."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6563
msgid ""
"Other beings say that we Orcs just aren't civilized. I now invite you in for a cup of tea to debate on this issue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6569
msgid ""
"The tea is hot, sweet and poisonous. The debate is over, and the Orcs won it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6575
msgid ""
"The limb swallows the gem. Deep in the trunk, something very large and very wooden wakes up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6587 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6599
msgid "The root drinks the gem. The bark parts on an Energy Disc."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:659
msgid ""
"Years ago King Burlock met Crodo, a kindly old sorcerer who became the King's friend. Baron Darzog, who was the King's master sorcerer, became very jealous of this friendship. I tried to warn the King that Darzog's jealousy would lead to no good, but he wouldn't listen to me. Now Crodo and Darzog have both disappeared and I fear that Crodo has been abducted. Perhaps Darzog has imprisoned him in his tower. If King Burlock were not so obsessed with the search for the Sixth Mirror, I'm sure he would have you search for him there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6622
msgid ""
"In this treehouse there once lived many sprites, but someone murdered the lot of them. You find two energy disks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6628
msgid ""
"A voice bellows: 'Feed the roots and the tree shall bear fruit! Feed the limbs and suffer the wrath of BARKMAN!'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6638 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6659
msgid "The fort collapses in a heap of burning timbers and smoldering ash."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:664
msgid ""
"See the King first. Everyone sees the King first. Then they come to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6649
msgid "You search the fort and find 2 energy disks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:667
msgid "Pyramids"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6671
msgid ""
"Smoke rises into the sky as you put the camp to the torch. Among the ashes, the tribe's small hoard of gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6685
msgid ""
"Sacks of gold, each stamped THIEVES' GUILD. Nobody else labels their gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:669
msgid ""
"The pyramid on the knoll east of Vertigo. Show it the sigil. Where it takes you, the King prefers not to know, so I don't tell him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6692 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:121
msgid "Hobstadt falls across the foot of his throne. The throne is vacant."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6702
msgid ""
"A message on thieves' guild letterhead reads: To all members: The Trolls have stolen our gold. Get it back no matter the cost!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6714
msgid ""
"Your troll sits on the throne of Hobstadt. It fits. He stands up a War Troll."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:672
msgid ""
"The old pyramids are said to lead to the land below the land. The Prince went there, they say, before he came home. The King will not hear of it. So, quietly: the Pyramid Sigil. Try the pyramid on the knoll east of Vertigo."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6720
msgid "Troll Hole. Descend?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6726
msgid ""
"Troll Juice. This stuff is poisonous, but the experience improves you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6732
msgid "You have had enough Troll Juice for one lifetime."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6740
msgid "Morgana is dead. Her robes keep glowing for a while, out of habit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6746
msgid ""
"The guild gate. Beyond it, the wizard quarter, and wizards who are sensitive to insults. Enter?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6754
msgid "Xenoc falls, still in the middle of a sentence about his betters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6764
msgid ""
"In a nest of spoons, buckles and broken mirrors: a magnifying glass, with 'CALEB' scratched on the handle. Very small."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6770
msgid ""
"A cave in the crag, its mouth white with droppings. Something up there is watching, very still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6779
msgid ""
"With great effort, you pound roosting rocks to powder and scatter the dust to the wind."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6794
msgid "You search the bloody throne and find two energy disks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6805
msgid ""
"A chalice of silver with white gold tracery, humming faintly. Nobody stops you taking it. Nobody says anything at all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:682 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:602
msgid "Newcastle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6823
msgid ""
"You set the Chalice back on its stand and say the oath, every word without a vowel. The knights come out of the walls. They say nothing, which you now understand as approval, and hand you two humming disks. The warriors among you leave as Black Knights and Villains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6831
msgid "The new member says the oath without a vowel, and the knights nod."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6839
msgid "Bosco's key turns. Over the door: \"Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:684
msgid ""
"If you want to make some improvements here you should see the King's engineers. Emerson, at Castle Burlock. I am sure he will be able to help you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6846
msgid "\"Gd. Ntr.\" The door beside you swings open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6852
msgid "Have you learned nothing of the Voweless Knights? Begone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6861
msgid "The fountain removes all effects of unnatural aging."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6864
msgid ""
"The water is venom-green and smells of it. Thaddeus shakes his head at you from his door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:687
msgid ""
"Wanna buy the land this lovely castle rests upon? Only twelve thousand gold! The rubble is included. So are the wood golems in the foundations."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6874
msgid ""
"The Jewel of Ages, on a stand of black glass. It is warm, and you feel no older for touching it. Possibly younger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6883
msgid ""
"Disc. Two Energy Disks, wired into a mage's experiment that no longer needs them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6894
msgid ""
"A letter sealed with Ellinger's mark, addressed 'To the Guildmaster of Sandcaster'. He left it where only those who could climb this tower would find it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:690
msgid "Buy the deed"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6913
msgid ""
"The lid swings up. Among the thieves' takings: a key marked with a mage's tower, and a receipt: 'Paid in full. One jewel.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6919
msgid "The gong booms three times and a door grinds open somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:692
msgid ""
"Thanks a lot! You won't regret your decision. Sign here. And here. The golems are yours too, of course."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6925
msgid ""
"A message on thieves' guild letterhead reads: To all members: Ring each gong three times. Three's the charm. The Ali Baba chest's word is 'open sesame'. Do NOT write this down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6934
msgid ""
"Energy Disc. Two, wrapped in a thieves' guild invoice made out to nobody."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6944
msgid ""
"Ledger. One (1) Griffin Statuette, sold to Mages of the Great Eastern Tower. One (1) Dragon Statuette, sold to Head Witch of Lakeside. One (1) Pegasus Statuette, sold to Head Heretical Cleric. One (1) Jewel of Ages, sold to Mages of the Great Eastern Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6957
msgid "For the eyes of the prince only!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6961
msgid "You know the Prince Book by heart. You learn nothing new."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6966
msgid ""
"The Prince Book: the private rules of the Prince of Thieves, written for one reader. You read them, and your luck seems to read over your shoulder. (+2 Luck, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6972
msgid ""
"The Manual of Master Thievery. Locks, lures, ledgers, and how to leave a room so that nobody remembers you were in it. You will remember it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6978
msgid "You learn nothing new."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:698
msgid ""
"Twelve thousand gold, not a copper less. The King's tax is the King's tax."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6998
msgid ""
"You wrench the bars out of the old mortar. Jasper squeezes through, says something grateful and muffled, and runs for his brother's house."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7008
msgid ""
"Statuette. A golden dragon, in a niche the witches thought nobody would reach. Nearby, a dead man's journal: '...still haven't a clue where that statuette is.' He was two steps from it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7018
msgid ""
"Statuette. A golden griffin in a mage's curio cabinet, labelled in a neat hand: 'Griffin, gold. Thaumic value: none. Bought anyway.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7028
msgid ""
"Statuette. A golden pegasus, bought by the heretics' high cleric to bless his heresy. It didn't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7039
msgid "Under the third log you find a heavy iron ring, warm to the touch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:704
msgid "Walls"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7050
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you for rescuing me! The witches were going to use me for spare parts in their potions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:706
msgid ""
"We want to make sure you approve of the work we have already done. Please go and take a look at your castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7061
msgid ""
"Thanks for getting me out of there. The witches turn people into monsters: the good ones guard Castle Blackfang, the rejects end up on the Isle of Lost Souls. There are others. Find them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7074
msgid ""
"My first is in water but not in tear. My second is in hire but not in hear. My third is in tree but not in peer. My fourth is in race but not in fear. My last is in sharp but not in spear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7082
msgid "Correct! As a reward, I give you free membership to the guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7088
msgid "Wrong! Begone fools!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:710 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:769
msgid ""
"Thanks! We'll have the work done by the time you get back to the site."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7106
msgid ""
"The brew tastes of toad and ambition. 'Welcome, sisters,' says a witch, whatever you are. Those of you who walk the green ways come up from the cauldron Warlocks. Members may also help themselves to the Head Witch's chest. Politely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7117
msgid ""
"(yawn) Thank you for saving me from my hideous fate. I am forever in your debt. I'll be going now. See you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7128
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving me. I'm tired of adventuring and I'm going home, but the dragon statuette is in the sewer below us. The witches caught me just as I was reaching for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7140
msgid "Under a spare hat: a pass to Necropolis, stamped by the dead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7150
msgid ""
"In a jar of green glass, in a fluid that should not still be warm: a heart, beating slowly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7164
msgid ""
"Sandro: Thank you for returning my heart. I am free of this life. You are welcome to the treasures in this room as well as this key. It opens the way to my old home on the other side of the world, a place now called the Dungeon of Death. Goodbye, brave mortals, and good luck. Remember: Alamar CAN be defeated."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7176
msgid ""
"Sandro laughs, a dry sound. \"Asked nicely. Very well.\" He shows your casters how the heart is parted from the body, and what it costs. The Priests among you rise as Priests of Dark, the Wizards as Liches."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7183
msgid ""
"Sandro the Lich rises from the floor, slower this time. \"My heart. You have it. Give it to me, and I will be free of this life.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7187
msgid ""
"Sandro: Do not come to me without my heart. Though you have defeated me once in combat, I still am not dead. Once again you must defeat me, or die."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7192
msgid ""
"Sandro rises from the floor as if nothing happened. \"I am Sandro, the most accomplished sorcerer to ever live in Xeen. Many years ago I separated my heart from my body to cheat death. It worked, but I am not wholly alive: I am a wretched and evil monster who must kill mortals to remain alive. Retrieve my heart from the sewers below here and I will finally be released, and you may have the treasure in this room.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7204
msgid ""
"Correct! You have solved my riddle. Please take the magical things that I have left in the care of these enchanted boulders. The boulder disappears and leaves behind a suit of golden plate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7210
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder says nothing. It is, after all, a boulder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7217
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My first is in apple and also in pear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7223
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My second is in cave and also in lair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7229
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My third is in fable and also in tale."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:723
msgid ""
"You don't have enough Megacredits. Five. Craftsmen don't count in gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7235
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My fourth is in lark and also in quail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7241
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My fifth is in wind but not in gale."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7247
msgid ""
"The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My sixth is in glimpse and also in sight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7253
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My last is in night but not in light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7259
msgid ""
"A weathered sign reads: A dying paladin gave all his magical armor to the enchanted boulders of the land for safekeeping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:727
msgid ""
"Every defensible piece of land needs a wall around it. I can have craftsmen and laborers working on your land for 5 King's Megacredits. Bring them and we'll start."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7271
msgid ""
"A throne of black horn stands where every corridor ends. Whoever reaches it has walked the labyrinth. The Minotaurs among you sit, and rise as lords of the maze."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7279
msgid "The Minotaur sits, and rises a lord of the maze."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7285
msgid "The Drawkcab Monks study the Palindrome."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7302
msgid "'Correct,' says a voice behind the door. 'Come in. Ni emoc.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7308
msgid ""
"WRONG!!! You call yourself a Drawkcab. You know nothing of the Drawkcab! Go to the monks for further enlightenment and return to me when you feel you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:731
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I cannot do any work on land that you do not own! Buy some land and we'll talk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7317
msgid ""
"P, I, T, C, H, F, O, R, K. The last lid drops. A pitchfork, spelled in chests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7326
msgid ""
"The ninth lid drops shut with a satisfying clunk. Nine closed chests. Somewhere, Dyson nods."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7337
msgid ""
"Rooka the Queen Rat is dead. Down the tunnel, someone in a bed cheers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:734
msgid "Workers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7347
msgid ""
"You find a diploma that reads: Valio Magnus, graduated 787 cum laude, School of Evil Wizardry. Valio smiles simply."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7351
msgid ""
"You hear Valio (the peasant hiding in the bed) yell, 'Hey, that's MY chest. Leave it alone!' You open it anyway. Inside, a diploma: Valio Magnus, cum laude, School of Evil Wizardry. Valio gets out of bed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:736
msgid ""
"While building the rest of your castle, a worker found another of those strange stones. Here it is."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7369 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7381
msgid ""
"The key turns and the heretics' wards on the door die with a small, sulky pop."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7390 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7408
msgid "Thank you for sparing my life. I shall be going now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7399
msgid ""
"Disc. Two of them, Energy Disks, set in the alcoves like offerings. Mok will not miss them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7418
msgid "On the altar, under a heretical candle: the key to the Western Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:742
msgid ""
"The workers have finished cleaning out the rubble and patching up the stone work. You should go inside and have a look around. Oh, one more thing. One of the workers found this stone while he was clearing away some fallen masonry. I thought you might be interested."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7425
msgid ""
"Hand over hand, past the arrow slits. Nobody looks out. The window at the top is open: heretics trust their wards, not their windows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7444
msgid "The mountains are full. Empty them first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7448
msgid ""
"The God of Minerals refills the mines for 10,000 gold. Minerals are not cheap. Gods are worse."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7456
msgid ""
"The God of Minerals takes your gold, which is, after all, a mineral. Somewhere in the rock, veins knit shut and fill again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:747
msgid ""
"If you have enough Megacredits you should think about building up your castle. The King's engineers should be able to help you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7478
msgid "You found an emerald handle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7493
msgid "Enter the Ancient Temple of Bark?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7502
msgid ""
"Monga Melons, three of them, ripe. Something with a great many legs objects."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7508
msgid ""
"Prisoner list. One Lich, known as Vexor the Black, to be held indefinitely, for the crime of Necromancy. One Lich, known as Clemon the Dead, the same. One Lich, known as Saxar the Permanent, the same. One Lich, known as Morgrath the Grey, the same. One Lich, known as Ulvane the Unrepentant, the same. One Bone Dragon, formerly Iron Vithnipravad, to be held until proper reburial can be arranged. One Bone Dragon, formerly Argonax, the same. One Bone Dragon, formerly Drothnavod the Weighty (A.K.A. Scraps), the same."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7517
msgid ""
"The last lich comes apart like a dropped bundle of kindling. The cells are quiet, for the first time since the castle came back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4064 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4080 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:753
msgid "Megacredits"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7533
msgid ""
"The last drum burns, and the caves fall silent but for dripping water. Without their drums the warband's raiders will not ride out again. Mayor Gunther will want to hear of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7543
msgid ""
"A skinny farm boy scrambles to his feet. \"You came! I'm Tam, Oslo's son. They were going to sell me back to Pa for every cow he's got. I can climb out myself now. I'll run straight home and tell him!\" He swarms up the rope ladder and is gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:755
msgid ""
"Three places. The Temple of Yak in Rivercity's south woods. The Tomb of a Thousand Terrors in the lagoon: the stone my workers find will open it. The Golem Dungeon in the tundra, by the lagoon: same again. Evil people hoard Megacredits. Don't ask me why."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7553
msgid "You found some money growing on this tree!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7559
msgid "Pest control by Joe"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7565
msgid "This space for rent"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7571
msgid "If you can read this ad, so can your customers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7577
msgid "REAL adventurers try Deep Mine Alpha!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:758
msgid ""
"King's Megacredits. The King mints them for his engineers, and somehow they all end up in evil places: the Temple of Yak, the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors and the Golem Dungeon. Fetch them; I build. Walls, keep and dungeon, five each."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7583
msgid "Mountains in your way? Try due N."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7589
msgid "School of Navigation 9N"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7598
msgid "What did you expect, money?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7606 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:478 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:484
msgid "You ruin their food, burn their tents, and poison their water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7615
msgid ""
"The encampment burns to the sound of distant howls of anger and frustration."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7621
msgid "Asp-->"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7627
msgid ""
"Every caravan adds a stone for luck on the crossing. You add yours, and feel luckier for it. (+Luck, until tomorrow)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7633
msgid ""
"Your stone is already on the cairn. Piling on more would be greed, and the desert notices greed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7639
msgid ""
"The urn is full of sand and old coins. Saul says the coins are for the sand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7645
msgid ""
"The Summer Druid's stones are warm long after dark. Their heat sinks into you. (+Fire resistance, until tomorrow)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:765
msgid ""
"The keep's up. Smith on the ground floor, a training hall above. Ebenezer says the workers found another stone. They're always finding stones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7651
msgid "The stones are warm, but you have had your share of their heat today."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7659
msgid ""
"You lift the bar from the desert side, and the yard gate swings open. Beyond it a coach waits, its driver asleep under a sign: WARZONE. ALL COMERS."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7679
msgid ""
"The statue's stone mouth moves: \"I dub all who find me 'Super Explorer'.\" You feel lighter on your feet. +2 Speed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7689 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7699
msgid ""
"Bones, feathers and stolen trinkets go up together. The harpies will nest somewhere lower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7709
msgid ""
"The nest burns, and the smoke drifts down through a gap in the cloud toward Vertigo."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7722
msgid "You teleported into the air outside the tower!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7728
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Remember, today is the first day of the rest of your life."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7734
msgid "The plaque reads: Don't worry, be happy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7740
msgid "The plaque reads: King Burlock's ceremonial armor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7746
msgid "The plaque reads: Have a nice day."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7752
msgid "The plaque reads: Prince Roland's ceremonial armor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7758
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Peasant's choice award--Best Ruler of the Year (597)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7764
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Remember, he who is too sharp sometimes cuts himself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7770
msgid "The plaque reads: Speak softly, but carry a large magic sword."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7776
msgid "The plaque reads: Remember, eat less and think thin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:782
msgid "You don't have enough Megacredits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:785
msgid "How about a keep to go with those walls? Just 5 Megacredits!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:792
msgid "Darzog's tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:794
msgid ""
"The Tower of High Magic stands in the lagoon. Mind the top floors: the wizards brewed things up there they never named."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:797
msgid ""
"Darzog sealed his tower with a Skeleton Key, and the Tower of High Magic keeps it for him. That tower's own key is sold by a talking skull deep in the Cave of Illusion, in the tundra. Skulls take gems, not gold: ten, for that key. Don't ask me what a skull does with a gem."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3544 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:804
msgid "Passes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:806
msgid "You've got one. I don't do refunds, and I don't do two."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:810
msgid ""
"One pass into Castleview, signed by the Mayor himself. Well, by someone. A thousand gold, and the guards never look past the seal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:815
msgid ""
"A pass is a thousand gold. Come back when you have it. The gremlins won't, if that's what you're hoping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:818 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:828
msgid "The orb"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:820
msgid ""
"Still have it? Good. Keep it away from my herbs. The mint went purple."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:823
msgid ""
"Something fell out of the sky last month and made a crater by the river. In the middle was this orb. It glows, it hums, and it looks at me. I don't want it. Take it to Madame Oorla; she reads things like that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:830
msgid ""
"The Pharaoh's orb wants to go home, but first it must see Ellinger. I don't make the rules. The orb does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:833
msgid ""
"Let me see... This orb belongs to the Dragon Pharaoh, in his pyramid in the desert. But first it must see Ellinger, the Queen's wizard. He locked himself in his tower with traps, so you will need his key, and at the top his tower will ask whom you seek: say his name, 'Ellinger'."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:843
msgid "Fortune"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:845
msgid ""
"I see a bird in a cage on an island, and a sad man in a castle. Free the one and the other will smile."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:849
msgid ""
"I see the castle growing back, stone by stone. More disks. Always more disks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:853
msgid ""
"I see little round things that hum. Twenty of them. Gremlins, sprites, ogres, the towers. Ellinger counts them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:857
msgid ""
"I see a tower full of traps and a man at the top who loves his boots. Go up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:861
msgid ""
"I see a woman who lost her necklace to the rats under the town, and holds a key she doesn't need. Nadia."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:864
msgid "I see an orb. Somebody nearby has one. Zelda, the herbalist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:867
msgid "Necklace"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:869
msgid "I wear it every day now, and I don't go near the drains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:873
msgid ""
"My necklace! It still smells of sewer, but it's mine. Here: Ellinger gave me a key to his tower years ago, to water his plants. I never did. You'll find a better use for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:883
msgid "The rats have it down there somewhere. Big rats. Organised rats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:886
msgid ""
"The rats came up the drain and took my onyx necklace right off the dresser. They live in the sewers under town. Bring it back and I'll give you something you'll want: the key to Ellinger's tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2696 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3592 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3824
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3832 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:890
msgid "Alamar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:892
msgid ""
"The castle can be restored to our world by casting certain complex spells powered by energy discs. Energy discs are rare magical batteries. I recently used the last of mine protecting this tower, and I haven't a clue where others may be found. Every five will restore a fourth part of the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:896
msgid ""
"Welcome. I'm sorry you had to run the gauntlet; my defenses keep Alamar's spies from my door. I see that you hold the Dragon Pharaoh's orb. Without it he cannot fight Alamar, and you must return it to him. But he has sealed his pyramid, and the key is in Queen Kalindra's castle, which Alamar moved out of phase when he took the Queen. Twenty energy discs will bring it back, five at a time. Bring them to me. And here is a little something: your gifts are in the chest that runs away from you in the south-west of Castleview. I will tell it to stay still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:904
msgid ""
"You climbed my tower without the Pharaoh's orb? Then you are either very brave or very lost. Come back when you hold it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1103 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:907
msgid "Energy discs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:909
msgid ""
"Have I taken the time to tell you that you are doing a wonderful job? All of you. I mean it. These discs will free the second level of the castle from Alamar's curse. Perhaps you will find more on the newly restored section."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:921
msgid ""
"Excellent work. You have brought enough discs to restore the first level of the castle. Go to the castle as soon as you can. Perhaps you will find more energy discs inside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:934
msgid ""
"Good, good. More discs. I still need five to restore level two of the castle. Keep the discs with you and come back when you have them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:938
msgid ""
"Ahh! I see you have energy discs for me! I will need five to power the spells that will restore the first level of the castle. Keep the discs with you and return when you have at least five. The world of Xeen is counting on you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:943
msgid ""
"No discs? Well, don't worry. When Alamar destroys the world, you won't be the only ones to die. Millions will go with you. That must be comforting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:946
msgid ""
"You haven't found any energy discs yet, eh? Perhaps you fail to grasp the urgency of your mission. ALAMAR IS GOING TO DESTROY XEEN! NOW GET BACK OUT THERE AND SAVE THE WORLD!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:952
msgid "Father"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:954
msgid ""
"The Songbird is on the isle in the lake, past Lakeside. The dungeon there is all doors that ask you to cheer up. Father would never get through them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:957
msgid ""
"My father Dimitri was captain of the Queen's guard. Since she was taken he sits in the dark and won't eat. Only the Songbird of Serenity could lift his despair, and it's caged in the Dungeon of Lost Souls on the lake isle. Here is the dungeon's key. Father kept it; he won't use it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:964
msgid "The Queen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:965
msgid ""
"The Queen is gone. What is a captain without a queen? A man in a chair. Leave me be."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:261 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1251 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1262
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:971
msgid "Lord Xeen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:973
msgid ""
"Dig, and say nothing at table. He smiles at me now. He never used to smile."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:976
msgid ""
"Crodo is home, and he says the Prince is... no. I believe him. I have watched that man not eat for a year. The King would not hear it, and the thing at his side would. So, quietly again: an Excavation Permit for Newcastle's dungeon. Emerson will dig where you tell him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:987
msgid "Dungeon"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:989
msgid ""
"Dug, shored and swept. There's a door at the bottom my men won't touch. It hums. I put a chalk mark on it: NOT MY DEPARTMENT."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:993
msgid ""
"A permit, signed and sealed, and five Megacredits. Lovely. The old dungeon was caved in by the bolt that took the castle. My men will have it open by the time you get there."
msgstr ""

