#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:147
msgid ""
"The cage is here, held fast by its brake. The brake lever is on this room's north wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:155
msgid "The cage comes up the slot."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:162
msgid "The brew scalds and stings: you flounder out of the cauldron."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:182
msgid "The cloud stair"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:177
msgid ""
"The clouds will bear only those sworn as Crusaders. Old Valia in Toad Meadow names Crusaders."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:181
msgid "You climb the stair of cloud into the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:190
msgid "Somewhere behind the bookcase, a child is crying."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:194 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:197
msgid "Wainscot"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:196
msgid ""
"A panel of the wainscot is loose: behind it, a goblin's hoard in a cupboard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:200 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:181
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:183
msgid "Bedchamber door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:208
msgid "Dormitory door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:142
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:148
msgid "Larder door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:220
msgid "The mistress's door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:223 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:226
msgid "Pen door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:232
msgid "Schoolroom doors"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:235 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:238
msgid "Warden's door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:241 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:244
msgid "The tower door: out to Toad Meadow"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:243
msgid "You push the tower door open into the meadow air."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:256
msgid ""
"The Head Witch shrieks a word: the witch-marks split, and her familiars crawl out of the floor!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:260 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:262
msgid "Roof hatch"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:274
msgid "The Head Witch shrieks, shrivels and is still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:280
msgid ""
"The hoist cage is held fast by its brake. The brake lever is on the hoist room's north wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:286
msgid "The winch creaks and the cage moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:300 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:302
msgid "A recipe card"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:301
msgid ""
"Strength brew - the vat with the TOAD on its lid. NOT the bubbling one (Agnes). NOT the green one, unless you want to be green."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:310
msgid ""
"Wind, and the whole of Toad Meadow below. Beyond the meadows the world simply ends, and the stars shine under it. Above you, a stair of cloud climbs into the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:314 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:323
msgid "The sleeping face"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:316
msgid ""
"A face of an old witch is carved in the door, fast asleep and smiling in her sleep. The door will not move. Under her chin, in a carved rosebud, is a keyhole: the coven's own key would fit it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:322
msgid ""
"The coven's key turns in the carved rosebud. The face sighs in her sleep, and the door parts down the middle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:326 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:349
msgid "Talking skull (Mind)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:337
msgid ""
"The skull spits out a scroll of Mind Blast. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:365 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:391
msgid ""
"'No gems, no scroll,' clacks the skull. 'Come back richer and prettier.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:344 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:370 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:396
msgid "'Cheapskate,' says the skull."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:347
msgid ""
"\"Feed me!\" the skull demands, and clacks its jaw. 'A scroll of Mind Blast for it, dearie. One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:348
msgid "Toss a gem (Yes/No)?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:35
msgid ""
"Green light flickers on black timber, and somewhere above, a cauldron bubbles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:352 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:375
msgid "Talking skull (Body)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:363
msgid ""
"The skull spits out a scroll of Heal. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:373
msgid ""
"The skull clacks its jaw. 'A scroll of Heal, dearie? One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:400
msgid "Pay a gem (Yes/No)?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:378 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:401
msgid "Talking skull (Air)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:389
msgid ""
"The skull spits out a scroll of Sparks. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:399
msgid ""
"The skull clacks its jaw. 'A scroll of Sparks, dearie? One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:404 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:406
msgid "The slate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:405
msgid ""
"HOW TO BE A PROPER GOBLIN.  1. Never say please.  2. Never wash.  3. Forget your name.  --  In the corner, small and half rubbed out, a child has scratched her own name: Rosebud. She has not forgotten it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:414
msgid "The steam scalds you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:418 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:422
msgid "Bubbling vat"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:421
msgid "Agnes's brew burns all the way down. You are poisoned."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:425 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:428
msgid "Green vat"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:427
msgid "Your skin turns green, and your knees turn to water. (Weak)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:431 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:446
msgid "Vat with a toad on its lid"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:433
msgid "The brew tastes of mud and does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:445
msgid ""
"It tastes of mud and nettles, and something in you grows stronger. (+2 to one stat, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:449 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:456
msgid "A shimmering ward"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:451
msgid ""
"A web of green witch-light bars the stair to the roof, the coven's moon-eye burning in it. Woven through the light, the words: ONLY THOSE SWORN AS CRUSADERS MAY PASS. You are not sworn. Old Valia in Toad Meadow names Crusaders: bring her the Alacorn first, and come back when she has named you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:455
msgid "The ward knows the Crusaders' oath. It sinks hissing into the floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:487 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:489
msgid "Winch drum"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:488
msgid ""
"The hoist's rope is wound on this drum. The brake lever is on the north wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:497
msgid ""
"In a cage by the west wall, a boy rattles the bars and points at the warden's strongbox: 'The keys! He keeps the keys in there!'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:506
msgid ""
"From a cage by the north wall, a girl hisses: 'Psst! Let me out and I'll tell you a secret!'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:510 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:519
msgid "Hoist gate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:512
msgid ""
"A plank gate closes the witches' hoist. Far above, something clanks - but nothing moves: the hoist's rope is held fast somewhere above. (The hoist's brake must be in the hoist room, by the coven's sanctum.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:57
msgid "Far below, the cauldron settles to a simmer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:606 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:608 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:611
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:613 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:616 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:618
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:621 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:623
msgid "Talking skull"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:607
msgid ""
"\"Don't forget to use the levitate spell before you enter the cloud world!\" the skull says."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:61 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:64
msgid "Bookcase"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:612
msgid ""
"\"Goblins back to work!\" the skull shouts. In the straw below, nobody moves any faster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:617
msgid "\"You are the fairest one of all,\" the skull says."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:622
msgid ""
"\"You are the most beautiful creature in all the land,\" the skull says."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:63
msgid ""
"The bookcase rises into the wall with a groan. Behind it, a cage, and a sobbing child."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:67 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:79
msgid "Hoist brake"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:69
msgid ""
"The brake is off: the hoist runs free. Ride the cage, or call it with the button beside either gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:78
msgid ""
"The brake comes off with a bang: the cage rattles away down the slot to the cauldron floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:116
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:82
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:92 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:95
msgid "Locked cage"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:84
msgid ""
"The cage is locked fast. Inside, a boy with pointed goblin ears grips the bars: 'The warden's keys! The big ring - he keeps it in his strongbox there. Get it and let me out!'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:97
msgid ""
"The cage is locked. The girl inside whispers: 'The warden's got the keys - a big ring, in the strongbox in his lodge off the gallery downstairs. Please let me out!'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:158 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:194
msgid "The drum collapses in a heap of ashes, smoke, and smoldering timber."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:122
msgid ""
"The Drum-Master falls and the great drum's beat breaks off. The drum itself still stands on the scaffold: burn it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:147
msgid "Signal drum"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:134
msgid ""
"The dry hide catches at once: the signal drum goes up in flames, and its beat drops out of the din."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:142
msgid "Nothing is left of the signal drum but a charred frame."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:183
msgid "Spirit drum"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:17
msgid ""
"Vertigo has not slept for a week: war drums boom out of the north hills every night, and every night orc raiders fall on another farm. Mayor Gunther asked you to silence them. The drums are in these caves: burn all three (the signal drum on the palisade's firing step, the shaman's spirit drum in the warren, and the great drum in the Drum Hall, where the Drum-Master beats it), and look for Tam, Oslo's boy, whom they carried off from his father's farm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:170
msgid ""
"The dry hide catches at once: the spirit drum goes up in flames, and its beat drops out of the din."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:178
msgid "Nothing is left of the spirit drum but a charred frame."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:212
msgid "Leave the Orc Caves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:215 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:221
msgid "Back gate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:217
msgid ""
"The gate is barred from inside: a heavy timber bar lies across it in two iron brackets. Lift the bar first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:220
msgid ""
"The gate opens a hand's breadth and stops: a fresh rockfall has buried the path down Mount Firestone's slopes. There is no way out here for now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:224 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:232 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:87
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:95
msgid "Gate bar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:226
msgid "The bar is up; the back gate is free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:23
msgid ""
"You put your shoulders to the boulder: it grinds aside and down into a hollow, and a low cave opens behind it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:231
msgid ""
"You heave the heavy bar up out of its brackets. The back gate is free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:235 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:238 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:241
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:244
msgid "Palisade gate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:252
msgid ""
"Across the hall, on a timber scaffold, the Drum-Master pounds the great war drum. Its gangway climbs from the west shelf."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:261
msgid ""
"Crude furnishings and filthy bedding tell you that orcs have been living in this cave. From a pit by the south wall a thin voice calls: \"Help! Please, get me out of here!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:27 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:35 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:104
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:117
msgid "Cage gate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:270
msgid "A palisade of logs blocks the cave. Orc archers on its firing steps!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:29
msgid "The cage gate is up; the rope ladder hangs down into the pit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:34
msgid ""
"You cut the lashings and heave the pole gate up. A rope ladder hangs down into the pit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:63
msgid ""
"Behind a curtain of hides a smaller drum rattles: the shaman's spirit drum."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:72
msgid ""
"Fresh drag marks run across the straw to a big boulder by the west wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:76 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:97
msgid "Great war drum"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:84
msgid ""
"The dry hide catches at once: the great war drum goes up in flames, and its beat drops out of the din."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:174 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:88
msgid "You leave the drum as it is, for now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:92
msgid "Nothing is left of the great war drum but a charred frame."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:95
msgid "You have found a war drum of the Orcs!  Destroy?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:102 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:158
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:253 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:255
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:260 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:120
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:127 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:63 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:65
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:70 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:45
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:47 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:50 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:52
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:55 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:57
msgid "Coffin"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:122
msgid "You are not strong enough to open the coffin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:140
msgid "Leave the Temple of Yak"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:148
msgid "West of the idol stands a barred gate: the clerics' treasury."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:154
