"The Iron Key turns. All is set: the great lock slides aside, and a stair goes down into a cold light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:397 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:399
msgid "Forge"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:398
msgid ""
"The forge's coals still glow, though no smith has worked them in an age."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:402 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:410
msgid "Home of the Iron"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:404
msgid "A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Iron"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:422
msgid "Six rocks glow. Far below, the Iron door grinds open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:431
msgid ""
"Through the window ahead: the Hall of the Plaque, and six lamps over the Iron door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:439
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the east bolt shoots home into the great lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:446
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the east bolt draws back from the great lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:454
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the north bolt shoots home into the great lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:461
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the north bolt draws back from the great lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:469
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the south bolt shoots home into the great lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:476
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the south bolt draws back from the great lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:485
msgid ""
"A lock as big as a door lies in the floor, three iron bolts shot into it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:510
msgid ""
"You touch the statue. Deep in the north wall a bar draws back, and the Stone door grinds open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:514 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:520
msgid "Home of the Stone"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:516
msgid "A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Stone"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:519
msgid ""
"A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Stone. The door is shut fast; there is no ring or keyhole."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:523 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:529 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:290
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:305
msgid "Vault door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:525
msgid "The vault stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:528
msgid ""
"The vault door is sealed. It will not move while the Diamond Golem stands."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:532 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:535
msgid "Home of the Wood"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:534
msgid "A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Wood"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:539 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:544 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:549
