#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:568 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:570
msgid "Golem forge"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:569
msgid ""
"An iron pot simmers on the coals. Here the golem-makers poured the iron limbs of their golems."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:96
msgid "The block grinds into its recess. Bare stone beneath it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:111 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:114
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:121 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:125
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:132
msgid "Cave wall"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:124
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:131
msgid "The mirage dissipates with your touch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:136
msgid ""
"A board, the words scratched deep: 'THE SKULLS TAKE GEMS, NOT GOLD. THE GREAT ONE AT THE BOTTOM WANTS TEN FOR HIS KEY - KEEP TEN. THE ECHO CAVE PAST THE GUARDIANS' POST KEEPS SOME. THE PLUG IN THE SLUICE LETS THE WATER OUT, IF YOU ARE STRONG.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:153
msgid "Bronze plug"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:142
msgid ""
"The plug hangs free on its chain. Below the window the reservoir lies empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:142
msgid "You aren't strong enough to pull the plug."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE CAVE OF ILLUSION. Warm, wet breath blows out of the ice into your faces. Artemus was plain about it: somewhere deep in this cave a talking skull sells the key to the Tower of High Magic, and skulls take gems, not gold. Mind the walls here: not all of them are there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:152
msgid ""
"You set your feet and heave on the chain. The bronze plug comes up out of its pool with a sucking roar, and through the window the black water of the reservoir begins to sink. The water roars away down the sump; somewhere below, stone gates grind open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:157
msgid "Your hand passes through the safe as though it were not there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:199
msgid "Great skull"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:227
msgid "Skull (Intellect)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:212
msgid ""
"The skull's jaw clacks shut on 5 of your gems. +3 Intellect (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:230 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:255
msgid "Skull (Luck)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:240
msgid "The skull's jaw clacks shut on 3 of your gems. +2 Luck (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:283
msgid "Skull (Personality)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:26
msgid "Shapes stir in the silt of the drained bed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:268
msgid ""
"The skull's jaw clacks shut on 3 of your gems. +2 Personality (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:286 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:311
msgid "Skull (Speed)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:296
msgid "The skull's jaw clacks shut on 5 of your gems. +3 Speed (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:32
msgid "A flask of red draught lies on top."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:69 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:71 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:74
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:76
msgid "Leave the Cave of Illusion"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:85
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:88 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:94 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:97
msgid "Sluice gate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:81 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:99
msgid ""
"The stone sluice gate is shut fast. Water presses against it from the other side."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:101 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:111
msgid "Stairway to Heaven"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:109
msgid "Stairway to Heaven.  Climb?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:121
msgid "Leave the Tower of High Magic"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:134 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:140
msgid "Frozen door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:136
msgid ""
"The door is frozen shut: a sheet of blue ice covers it from lintel to sill, and its hinges are lost in it. A steam pipe runs cold along the wall to its frame, back toward the reagent store."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:149 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:165
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:193
msgid "Lift gate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:167 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:189
msgid ""
"The lift gate is bolted. The lever beside it on the wall works the bolt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE TOWER OF HIGH MAGIC. The Enchanted Key from the Cave of Illusion turns, and the door shuts again behind you with a sound like a held breath. Artemus was plain about it: the Skeleton Key that opens Darzog's Tower lies with the Archmage who built this place, in his study at the very top. Six laboratories climb the floors between, and their keepers will not welcome you. The stairs go up the east and west sides in turn."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:152 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:174
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:196 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:206
msgid "Gate lever"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:154 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:198
msgid "The lever is down and the gate stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:183 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:205
msgid ""
"The bolt shoots back and the brass gate rises. Beyond it the cage will answer you now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:20 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:22
msgid "The Art of Magic"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:209 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:215
msgid "Librarian's door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:21
msgid ""
"THE ART OF MAGIC. 'Every spell is a door, and every door a lock. The novice forces the lock; the master learns the shape of the key. Fire wants feeding, water wants a vessel, air will go where it likes, earth will not go at all. Learn what each wants, and it will come to your hand as a dog comes to its name.' The rest is the Archmage's notes in the margins, in a hand too small to read."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:211
msgid ""
"The door is locked. Its keyhole is cut in the shape of an open book: the Librarian's Key, which the Head Sorceress keeps about her in the magic lab."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:223 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:230 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:257
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:264 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:291 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:298
msgid "Brass cage"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:225 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:247
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the first floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:263 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:297
msgid "The cage creaks on its chains and moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:235
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the first floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:241 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:253 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:275
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:287 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:309 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:321
msgid "Chains rattle in the shaft and the cage moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:259 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:281
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the second floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:269
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the second floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:293 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:315
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the top floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:303
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the top floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:327
msgid "MYSTERIES OF LIGHT, says the brass plate on the cabinet's door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:331 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:341
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:344
msgid "Pandorian Box"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:343
msgid "The box is empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:35 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:43
msgid "Cold Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:358 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:368
msgid "Steam valve"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:360
msgid "The valve is open as far as it goes; steam hisses in the pipes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:367
msgid ""
"You heave the steam valve round. The pipes knock and hiss along the walls, and from the garden beyond the still comes the crack and drip of thawing ice: the frozen door of the west stair stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:37
msgid "You have drunk the Cold Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:42
msgid ""
"COLD BREW. Frost creeps up the ladle. It is like swallowing a winter, and afterwards the cold cannot find you: +5 Water resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:54
msgid "Electric Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:48
msgid ""
"You have drunk the Electric Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:53
msgid ""
"ELECTRIC BREW. The brew crackles blue between the coils and stings your tongue like a storm: +5 Air resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:57 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:65
msgid "Energy Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:59
msgid "You have drunk the Energy Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:64
msgid ""
"ENERGY BREW. It glows yellow in the ladle and hums in your bones for a long moment: +5 Earth resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:76
msgid "Fire Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:70
msgid "You have drunk the Fire Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:75
msgid ""
"FIRE BREW. A red brew that smokes in its cauldron by the athanor. It burns going down, and the heat stays in you: +5 Fire resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:87
msgid "Magic Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:81
msgid "You have drunk the Magic Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:86
msgid ""
"MAGIC BREW. Violet, and stranger than it looks: for a moment you hear your own thoughts from outside. Then the mind closes, stronger: +5 Mind resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:98
msgid "Poison Brew"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:92
msgid "You have drunk the Poison Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:97
msgid ""
"POISON BREW. Nightshade and hemlock, boiled down until they cure what they once caused. Bitter, and then nothing at all: +5 Body resistance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:126
msgid ""
"Seven figures in the Baron's robes turn as one. 'Which of us,' they ask together, 'will you kill first?'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:146
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:156 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:412 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:422
msgid "Darzog's disc"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:174
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:414
msgid ""
"A disc of black stone hangs in the Well behind this grille, the Baron's rune glowing on its rim. It answers to Darzog alone while he lives."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:155
msgid "The disc hums and glides along the Well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:148
msgid ""
"You press the stone. Far above, at the top of the Well, a rune flares and dies: whatever it calls is bound by its master, up on his own floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:169
msgid "Call the disc"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:168
msgid "The disc rises up the Well to the landing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:172 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:178
msgid "Black grille"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:177
msgid ""
"The grille opens when the disc is here. Step onto the disc and touch it to ride down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:186 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:189
msgid "Darzog's doors"
msgstr ""

