msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:260
msgid "Darzog's journal"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:259
msgid ""
"DARZOG'S JOURNAL, the last page: '... The old fool Crodo sits behind my own portrait in my bedchamber, where he may admire me while he rots. Let him send his dreams to Newcastle's tinkers; no spell leaves this tower, and no spell enters it but mine. My new master in the clouds is pleased. When the King's precious \"brother\" sits the throne, I shall have Crodo's place at last.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:268 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:277
msgid "The library stair door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:270
msgid ""
"Locked. The keyhole is cut as a sorcerer's sigil. The Chief Librarian keeps the key to the upper stair in his cabinet in the great library, south of the Well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:276
msgid "The library key turns in the carved lock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:28
msgid ""
"BOOK OF ACCURACY. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Accuracy (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:287
msgid "Darzog's portrait"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:282
msgid ""
"The Baron in oils, haughty and gaunt. Behind the painted eyes something moves: an old man's face, pressed to the other side, then gone. The frame will not shift while Darzog's spell holds it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:286
msgid ""
"With Darzog dead, the portrait is only paint and wood. It slides up into the wall on a cell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:300
msgid ""
"Wind, and the whole of Lake Darzog below. Above the roof a stair of cloud climbs into the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:314 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:317
msgid "Leave Darzog's Tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:316
msgid "You pull the tower door open on the wind off the lake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:40
