#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:340 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:346
msgid ""
"The cracked flags give way under you! You drop through to the works below."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:34
msgid "You have already learned what the book of endurance can teach."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:351
msgid ""
"A note, pinned at the head of the stair in a hurried hand: 'MIND THE CRACKED FLAGS. The Master's hatches drop you straight down to the works, and the hands down there are not friendly. Walk round them. -- Wil'"
msgstr ""

