msgid "New masonry"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:157
msgid ""
"Fresh masonry closes the old rubble slope. Emerson's men left a chalk mark: FILLED IN (KEEP)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:167
msgid "Rubble: fallen roof stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:18
msgid ""
"Emerson's diggers have been and gone: the old dungeon stair beyond the statue court is open, the chapel and the counting room have their doors, and water stands in YOUR well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:186 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:188
