msgid "Newcastle Training Hall"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:198
msgid ""
"A cold hearth under a missing roof. Emerson's chalk mark on the wall reads: SMITHY (KEEP)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:259
msgid "The way down is clear now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:262
msgid ""
"A short distance down the stairs you find the way blocked with rubble. You are unable to continue down, so you come back up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:267
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Built in honor of Great Adventurers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:271 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:273
msgid "Rack"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:276 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:278
msgid "Shelf"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:283
msgid ""
"Rubble and an old practice dummy. Emerson's chalk mark reads: TRAINING (KEEP)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:297
msgid "Incorrect! The door hums a little louder. Nothing else happens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:30
msgid ""
"Newcastle Keep. Fresh mortar, a new roof, and Newcastle's banners over the hall. The smith and the master at arms have moved in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:304
msgid "What is the password?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:304
msgid "laboratory"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:317 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:324 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:327
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:329
msgid "YOUR well"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:319 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:328
msgid ""
"YOUR well. Dry, and choked with rubble: the diggers have not reached it yet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:323
msgid ""
"Even your well's water is cool and refreshing. (Armour class +20 until you rest.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:332 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:334
msgid "Woodpile"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:333
msgid ""
"Woodpile: the old roof's beams, sawn and stacked. Some of the stack has arms."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:42
msgid ""
"The ruins of Newcastle. Beyond the gate the great hall's roof has fallen in, and among the old timbers something heavy creaks and moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:48
msgid "Sack"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:52
msgid "Bones: whoever stood in the hall when the bolt struck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:61
msgid ""
"Lagoon water has seeped into the old cellar and stands black between the walls. Something in it breathes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:178
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:65 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:71
msgid "Chapel of Newcastle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:67
msgid ""
"An empty chapel with no altar. Emerson's chalk mark reads: CHAPEL (DUNGEON STAGE, DON'T ASK)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:182 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:183
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:89 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:95
msgid "Newcastle Counting Room"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:91
msgid ""
"A bare room with an iron ring in the floor. Emerson's chalk mark reads: BANK (DUNGEON STAGE)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:98
msgid "Arms of Newcastle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:113
msgid "Scratched over the dicing table: NOW THIS IS A WILD TOWN."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:119
msgid "Dues box"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:118
msgid ""
"The gang's dues box. Empty. Scratched beside the slot: WHAT DID YOU EXPECT, MONEY?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:124
msgid "Quay door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:127 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:134
msgid "Fence's door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:129
msgid ""
"Locked: a good lock from Rivercity Smithing. A thief who can disarm traps (skill 3) could pick it; the boss's keys would open it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:133
msgid "The lock gives with a click."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:142
msgid ""
"Wet footprints lead from the drain to the north wall and stop dead at the stones. One block is cleaner than the rest, worn smooth by hands."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:148
msgid "Boss's ledger"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:147
msgid ""
"The Robber Boss's ledger. Takings by the week; a royal tiara, 'not to be fenced'; and at the foot, underlined twice: STRONGROOM - throw the catch by the hearth BEFORE you walk the passage. Darts for anyone who forgets. That means you, Weasel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:151 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:159
msgid "Loose brick"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:153
msgid "An empty hole behind a loose brick."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:158
msgid "Behind the loose brick: a robber's purse. 150 gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:166
msgid "Worn block"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:165
msgid ""
"You push the worn block: it slides aside on greased runners. A brick passage runs north into the dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:179
msgid ""
"The river roars in through the grate. The old sluice wall makes a catwalk across the race."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:188
msgid ""
"Voices above: \"...a royal tiara won't fence in Rivercity, boss. Too hot.\" \"Then it stays in the strongroom till it cools.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:198
msgid "A tripwire! A crossbow bolt whips out of the wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:207
msgid ""
"You stand inside the great bridge. Carts rumble overhead; the race runs dark and fast beneath. The robbers' plank bridge is drawn back to the far bank."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:213
msgid ""
"An iron door with three locks. The Robber Boss carries the keys on a ring at his belt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:218
msgid "The three keys turn one after another, and the iron door grinds up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:222 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:232
msgid "Bridge winch"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:224
msgid "The bridge is out across the race."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:231
msgid ""
"The winch clanks round: the plank bridge rolls out across the race to the west bank."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:63 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:72
msgid "Catch"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:65
msgid "The catch is thrown: the passage's darts are locked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:71
msgid ""
"You throw the catch. Deep in the wall of the passage something ratchets and locks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:99
msgid "Click. Darts hiss out of the walls!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:107
msgid ""
"The moon gallery. Below, the frozen mere stretches away under the sky, and the wind pulls at your cloaks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:112
msgid ""
"The gong booms through all five storeys, and the pagoda falls silent to listen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:119
msgid "Mat"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:118
msgid ""
"A draught comes up between the floorboards. The mat lifts: a trapdoor, and a ladder down into the dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:124
msgid "Hearth"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:123
msgid "The kitchen hearth, cold. Rice is trodden into the ashes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:127 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:129
msgid "Table"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:128
msgid ""
"Kai Wu's rice jars, smashed. Whoever did it was looking for something, or for nothing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:132 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:134
msgid "Winterkill Tundra"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:142
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:144 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:149
msgid "Weapon rack"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:148
msgid ""
"Racks of blades, bows and shuriken. The best of it is locked in the chest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:157
msgid ""
"Paper screens stand everywhere, lit from behind. Shadows move on the paper, and stop when you do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:167
msgid "Shinobu"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:165
msgid "A worn cushion on the cellar floor, still warm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:18
msgid ""
"The barred door gives way. The pagoda smells of cold incense and lamp oil, and somewhere above a floorboard creaks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:201 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:203 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:206
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:208 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:213
msgid "Straw target"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:207 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:212
msgid "A straw target, bristling with shuriken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:216 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:218
msgid "Weapon wall"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:217
msgid "Wooden practice blades, worn smooth at the grip."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:23
msgid ""
"The monks' bell, green with age. Kai Wu rang it every dawn, until the Evil Ninja clan drove him from his sacred home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:27 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:29
msgid "Broom"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:28
msgid ""
"A broom, dropped where an old monk let it fall. \"There are still Ninja in my Pagoda,\" Kai Wu said. Nobody has swept since."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:37
msgid ""
"The clan's storeroom: coils of rope, bolts of black cloth, sacks of rice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:56 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:58
msgid "The clan's banner"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:57
msgid ""
"A black banner with a carrion bird: the clan's mark, hung over a monk's altar."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:73 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:76
msgid "Crane screen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:75
msgid ""
"The paper tears from top to bottom, and the crane falls away. Behind it a stair climbs into the dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:10 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:8
msgid "Altar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:84 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:87
msgid "Sliding door"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:9
msgid ""
"Kai Wu's altar. The clan has hung its black banner over it, and the incense bowls are full of shuriken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:109
msgid ""
"A great hall under the mound, hot and reeking. The Troll Matron rises from her bedding by the fire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:123
msgid ""
"Frozen carcasses lie stacked under the hides: deer, a horse, and things you would rather not name."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:137
msgid ""
"The Troll Matron falls. Her fire still burns in its pit under the chimney."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:14
msgid "The stench of this cave tells you that Trolls have been living in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:151 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:153
msgid "Hides in the chimney"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:152
msgid ""
"Frozen hides are rammed up the chimney over the fire. The smoke seeps out round them; nothing else could."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:161
msgid ""
"This hollow is filled with things that Trolls find valuable: bones, fist-sized rocks and hides. A hunter's pack lies among them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:173
msgid "The mound's crown"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:18 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:20
msgid "Gnawed bark"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:19
msgid ""
"Strips of the Troll Forest's bark, gnawed and spat out. Thickbark said it: \"They gnaw on our bark to sharpen their teeth in a most uncivilized fashion. Friends don't gnaw on friend's bark.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:87 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:130
msgid "You leave the lair as it is, for now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:91
msgid "Ash and charred bones fill the fire pit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:91
msgid "The trolls' fire burns in its pit. The Matron is near."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:94
msgid ""
"The stench of this cave tells you that Trolls have been living in it. It is filled with things that Trolls find valuable:  Bones, straw beds, fist-sized rocks and hides.  Destroy the lair?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:101 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:148
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:99
msgid "Hide curtain"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:110
msgid ""
"Behind the dais a slab of the wall sinks into the floor: a narrow stair climbs into the dark, the Count's own way up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:116
msgid "Up to Nightshadow's square"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:121
msgid ""
"The door refuses to budge. A symbol etched on its surface flashes pale blue whenever you try to move it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:126
msgid ""
"The symbol on the iron door flares once and goes dark. The door swings inward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:130 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:132
msgid "Moon window"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:131
msgid ""
"A window painted on the stone: a full moon over Nightshadow. The chapel's congregation never wanted a real one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:137
msgid "Portrait"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:136
msgid ""
"Count Draco, painted in the fashion of one century or another. Every portrait in the gallery has the same pale face."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:145
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:147
msgid "Inscription"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:141
msgid ""
"Words are cut into the foot of the great sarcophagus: Open his coffin and bid him farewell; only then can you use the magic of the well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:146
msgid ""
"Cut into the stone over the iron door: Only at night can you put up a fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:150 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:152
msgid "Feast table"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:151
msgid ""
"A long table laid for guests who never left. The wine has dried to a black crust in the goblets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:21
msgid ""
"Draco's coffin was a door: the stair under it ends in the old crypt of Nightshadow. Somewhere below, the Count sleeps by day. The town's signs said the rest: only at night can you put up a fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:25 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:27
msgid "Sexton's cot"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:26
msgid ""
"The sexton's cot. The blanket is folded; he went out one night and came back different."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:65
msgid ""
"A narrow ramp, worn smooth by one pair of feet over many centuries, climbs toward the crypt above."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:10 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:8
msgid "Black altar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:9
msgid ""
"A black altar under a painted moon. The candles on it burned down long ago, and nobody here needs light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:101
msgid ""
"The coloured light falters, flickers and sinks into the floor with a dying hum."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:110
msgid ""
"A message appears in the stone over the wall of light: Alternate the colors around the well / Then the machine can no longer repel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:121
msgid "Drain grate"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:116
msgid "An iron grate over a drain, bolted fast from the other side."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:12
msgid ""
"Stone steps lead down from Asp's square into the dark. Sloughed snakeskins lie on every tread, and from below comes a dry hissing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:120
msgid "You draw the bolt and the grate swings up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:134
msgid ""
"The transformer: four bronze coils taller than a man round a chamber of bars, an empty socket shaped like a scarab in its face, and in its crown a cluster of crystals pulsing blue. The floor hums under your feet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:143
msgid ""
"Shed snakeskins hang from poles across the room like washing, grey and papery. In a corner stands a chest of things that once belonged to people."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:16 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:19
msgid "Door to Asp's square"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:160
msgid ""
"Three barred cages stand against the west wall. The people in them are half turned: scales on their arms, eyes gone yellow. One whispers: \"Don't let them take us down to the machine.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:171
msgid "Straw Bed"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:18
msgid "You climb out into Asp's square."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:183
msgid ""
"The cages stand open. The townsfolk, their scales already flaking away, crowd round you: \"Thank you for saving us!\" Then they hurry up the stair toward the daylight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:207
msgid "You leave the machine humming. Somewhere above, someone hisses."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:214
msgid "You have found the transformer!  Do you wish to destroy it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:27
msgid ""
"Straw, shed skin and the reek of snake: the brood hall, where new snake men lie fresh from the machine below."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:34
msgid "Loose slab"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:33
msgid "The slab grinds down into the floor. Behind it, a hiding hole."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:37 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:43
msgid "Barred cage"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:39
msgid "The cage gates stand open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:42
msgid ""
"The gates are held by brass wires that run down through the floor to something below. They will not open while it works."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:66
msgid ""
"Asp's old cistern, dry for years. Something long and scaled moves in the basin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:81
msgid "Crystal housing"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:90
msgid ""
"The channel climbs toward a grate. On this side, a heavy bolt holds it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:102 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:94
msgid "Field of light"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:103 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:111
msgid "Hoist"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:105 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:116
msgid ""
"The platform hangs on its ropes at the ledge above. Its winch must be in the cave beside you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:110
msgid "The platform creaks on its ropes and moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:127
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:137
msgid "Call rope"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:12
msgid ""
"The cave runs into the mountain and opens on a shaft so tall its top is lost in shadow. Wings beat somewhere far above."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:123 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:136
msgid "You pull the rope; the platform creaks on its ropes and moves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:129
msgid ""
"The rope will not run: the hoist's winch in the fence's cave below is still locked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:41
msgid ""
"Crates and sacks stand along the walls, each with a tag on a string: \"Deliver to Asp: one silver mirror.\" \"Deliver to Asp: two candlesticks.\" Someone pays the gargoyles to steal, and keeps the goods here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:45 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:48
msgid "Hanging moss"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:47
msgid ""
"You push the hanging moss aside. Behind it a crack opens on a hidden ledge."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:51 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:53
msgid "Leave the Gargoyle Eyrie"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:56 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:58
msgid "Great nest"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:66
msgid ""
"The matriarch's roost: a great nest of sticks and bones, heaped with things that glitter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:75
msgid ""
"Ledges climb the walls of the shaft, one above another, and a rope bridge sags across it high overhead. Grey shapes wheel between them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:81
msgid "Climb out through the crack"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:86
msgid ""
"The winch is wound out; the hoist answers its deck and its call ropes now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:94
msgid ""
"You crank the winch. A rope runs out through a hole in the rock, and beyond the wall a plank platform comes creaking down on its ropes from the high ledge."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:100 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:98
msgid "Tagged crates"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:99
msgid ""
"Each crate has a tag on a string. One tag is a scrap torn from a complaint to the Burlock watch, in a careful hand: \"I know not why they took it, only that gargoyles are hired to steal things for people.\" Under it someone has scrawled: \"Deliver to Asp. Quickly.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:100
msgid "The bar lies across the gate in its forked posts. Lift the bar first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:109
msgid ""
"The log gate does not move: it is barred on the inside. A reek of old bones and rotten meat blows from a crack in the west wall of the mouth: the ogres throw their scraps down there, and what they throw down, you can climb up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:139
msgid "Ogre lair"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:134
msgid ""
"The Chieftain's seat of boulders, hung with the trophies of Nystor's boats. Break it now and his band will only pile it up again: the Chieftain throws from the ledge beyond the quarry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:137
msgid "You have found an Ogre lair.  Destroy?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:144
msgid ""
"A heavy plank door with an iron lock. The Ogre Chieftain keeps its key on his belt; he directs the boulder throwing on the ledge beyond the quarry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:156
msgid ""
"Daylight and the roar of the river! The ledge hangs over the gorge. At its south end a heap of boulders waits on a timber rack, and the Ogre Chieftain bellows at his throwers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:165
msgid ""
"Bones and refuse slither under your feet: the ogres throw their scraps down this crack. Something growls above."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:180
msgid "Boulder rack"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:189
msgid ""
"You went over the parapet and fell into the river below. The current tumbled you down the gorge and cast you up, half drowned, at the foot of the bluff, and you have climbed back up to the lair's mouth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:51
msgid ""
"The Ogre Chieftain crashes down. A heavy iron key hangs from his belt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:62
msgid "A boulder comes bounding down the chute behind you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:66 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:68
msgid "Leave the Ogre Lair"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:83
msgid ""
"Below, a great cauldron bubbles over the fire in the cooking pit: the ogres' supper. Best not to look in."
